                                       <path d=\"M8.7207 10.6397L15.0001 7.5\" stroke=\"#323232\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path>\r\n                                            <path d=\"M8.70605 13.353L15 16.5\" stroke=\"#323232\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path>\r\n                                        </svg>\r\n                                    </div>\r\n\r\n                                </div>\r\n\r\n                            </div>\r\n                        </div>\r\n\r\n                        \r\n                    </div>\r\n\r\n                </div>\r\n            </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"hiddenLike\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"row app-notification\" style=\"display: inline-block; background-image: url(https://cdn.outsavvy.com/website/page-bg-dark.png); margin-bottom: 20px;\">\r\n                <div class=\"col-lg-1 col-md-1 col-sm-0 col-xs-0 col\"></div>\r\n                <div class=\"col-lg-10 col-md-10 col-sm-12 col-xs-12 col\">\r\n                    <div class=\"row\">\r\n                        <div class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-4 col-sm-12 col-xs-12 col\" style=\"display: flex; align-items: flex-end;\">\r\n                            <img src=\"https://cdn.outsavvy.com/website/preloader.jpg\" data-src=\"https://cdn.outsavvy.com/website/app-notification.jpg\" class=\"app-intro lazy\" />\r\n                        </div>\r\n                        <div class=\"col-lg-8 col-md-8 col-sm-12 col-xs-12 col event-description\">\r\n                            <h3 style=\"text-align: center;\">Track your loved events in your profile or on the OutSavvy App</h3>\r\n                            <ul>\r\n                                <li>Store your tickets securely on the app</li>\r\n                                <li>Browse and buy tickets on the go</li>\r\n                                <li>Get app notifications when tickets go on sale to make sure you are first in the queue</li>\r\n                            </ul>\r\n\r\n                            <div class=\"actions\" style=\"text-align: center; margin-top: 20px;\">\r\n                                <a class=\"btn ui-gradient-green btn-app-store btn-download shadow-lg\" href=\"https://apps.apple.com/gb/app/outsavvy/id722344276\" target=\"_blank\"><span>Available on the</span> <span>App Store</span></a>\r\n                                <a class=\"btn ui-gradient-blue btn-google-play btn-download shadow-lg\" href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.outsavvyapp\" target=\"_blank\"><span>Available on </span><span>Google Play</span></a>\r\n                            </div>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n                <div class=\"col-lg-1 col-md-1 col-sm-0 col-xs-0 col\"></div>\r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <div id=\"description\">\r\n            <div style=\"margin-bottom: 0\">\r\n                <section>\r\n\r\n                    <h1 class=\"event-item event-item-name\">TRANSMISSIONS PRESENTS: Backseat of the Couch UK PREMIERE + Gregg Araki's This Is How The World Ends</h1>\r\n\r\n                    \r\n\r\n                    <div class=\"content-body\">\r\n\r\n                        <div class=\"line-red-holder\">\r\n                            <h4 class=\"line-red\" style=\"margin-top: 5px;\">Details\r\n\r\n                            </h4>\r\n                        </div>\r\n\r\n                        <div class=\"event-description\">\r\n                            <span><p><strong>After stops in Rome, Vienna, New York, and a feature in Interview magazine, Kiernan Francis' kaleidoscopic portrait of big dreams in NYC makes its UK debut at Transmissions.</strong></p><p>Going far beyond the nightlife trappings we've come to expect from queer cinema, <i>Backseat of the Couch</i> (2024) is a remarkably expansive ode to the underground, the bag chasers, the dolls, and the ones still figuring it out that glides from mornings after to nights before, from acting classes to hookups infront of housemates.</p><p>With a DIY foundation and shades of <strong>Gus Van Sant, Harmony Korine</strong>, and <strong>Gregg Araki</strong>, it felt only right to open the night with a rare showing of Araki's manic unaired MTV pilot<i> This Is How The World Ends</i> (2000).</p><p><strong>Come for the candy rich visuals and soundtrack packed with Midwest Emo and fresh Hyperpop, and stay for a film that feels like so much more than audiences are asked to accept from contemporary portrayals of city life.</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"image\"><img style=\"aspect-ratio:700/393;\" src=\" https://cdn.outsavvy.com/eventembed/b7ec4d8d-ccfc-4a20-b9db-20e08147dbd1.png  \" width=\"700\" height=\"393\"></figure><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Subtitles will be displayed throughout Backseat of the Couch only.</strong></p><p><strong>Seating is a mixture of benches, backed chairs, bar stools, and floor space, and is first come, first served.</strong></p></span>\r\n                        </div>\r\n\r\n                        \r\n\r\n<div class=\"map-event\">\r\n\r\n    <div id=\"event_map\" class=\"event-map\">\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"map-container\">\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"col-lg-12 col-md-12 col-sm-12 col-xs-12\" style=\"padding-right: 0px; padding-left: 0px;\">\r\n                <div class=\"line-red-holder\">\r\n                    <h4 class=\"line-red\">Location\r\n    \r\n                    </h4>\r\n                </div>\r\n                <div class=\"map-padding website-map\">\r\n\r\n                    <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&z=12&query=Dalston+Superstore%2c+117+Kingsland+High+Street%2c+London%2c+E8+2PB\" target=\"_blank\" onclick=\"return confirm('Would you like to open Google Maps?');\">\r\n\r\n                        <img src='data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 800 200\"%3E%3C/svg%3E' data-src=\"/Services/MapboxHandler.ashx?lng=-0.0753984&lat=51.5501&w=800&h=200&zoom=16\" class=\"lazy\" alt=\"Event location map\" />\r\n\r\n                    </a>\r\n\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"map-padding mobile-map\">\r\n\r\n                    <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&z=12&query=Dalston+Superstore%2c+117+Kingsland+High+Street%2c+London%2c+E8+2PB\" target=\"_blank\" onclick=\"return confirm('Would you like to open Google Maps?');\">\r\n\r\n                        <img src='data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 800 200\"%3E%3C/svg%3E' data-src=\"/Services/MapboxHandler.ashx?lng=-0.0753984&lat=51.5501&w=500&h=250&zoom=16\" class=\"lazy\" alt=\"Event location map\" />\r\n\r\n                    </a>\r\n\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"col-lg-12 col-md-12 col-sm-12 col-xs-12\" style=\"padding-left: 0px;\">\r\n\r\n                    <p><span class=locName>Dalston Superstore</span><br/>117 Kingsland High Street, London, E8 2PB</p>\r\n\r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n                            <div class=\"line-red-holder\">\r\n                                <h4 class=\"line-red\">Tagged\r\n\r\n                                </h4>\r\n                            </div>\r\n\r\n                            <div class=\"eventtags\">\r\n                                <span class=\"eventspan\">\r\n                                    <a href=/hashtag/londonevents><svg class=\"svgfill\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"800px\" height=\"800px\" viewBox=\"0 0 48 48\">\r\n  <title>location</title>\r\n  <g id=\"Layer_2\" data-name=\"Layer 2\">\r\n    <g id=\"invisible_box\" data-name=\"invisible box\">\r\n      <rect width=\"48\" height=\"48\" fill=\"none\"/>