                        </div>\r\n                            <div class=\"thumb-text-holder\">\r\n                                <h2 class=\"thumb-entry-title\">\r\n                                    Bank Holiday Monday with The D.E Experience\r\n                                </h2>\r\n                                \r\n                                <div class=\"banner-entry-location\">Royal Vauxhall Tavern - Monday 31st August 2026</div>\r\n                                \r\n                            </div>\r\n                        </article>\r\n                    </a>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n    </div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"menu_footer_buttons\">\r\n                    <div class=\"nav-coll-links\">\r\n\r\n                        \r\n                        <a class=\"nav-coll-link\" href=\"/accountlogin\">Login</a>\r\n                        <a class=\"nav-coll-link\" href=\"/register\">Register</a>\r\n                        \r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <footer class=\"menu_footer\">\r\n\r\n                    <div id=\"footer-apps\">\r\n                        <div class=\"actions\">\r\n                            <a class=\"btn ui-gradient-green btn-app-store btn-download shadow-lg\" href=\"https://apps.apple.com/gb/app/outsavvy/id722344276\" target=\"_blank\"><span>Available on the</span> <span>App Store</span></a>\r\n                            <a class=\"btn ui-gradient-blue btn-google-play btn-download shadow-lg\" href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.outsavvyapp\" target=\"_blank\"><span>Available on </span><span>Google Play</span></a>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n\r\n                    <div class=\"menu_footer_links\">\r\n                        <a class=\"menu_footer_link\" href=\"/aboutus\">About</a>\r\n                        <a class=\"menu_footer_link\" href=\"/support\">Support</a>\r\n                        <a class=\"menu_footer_link\" href=\"/resell\">ReSell</a>\r\n                        <a class=\"menu_footer_link\" href=\"/contactus\">Contact</a>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </footer>\r\n\r\n            </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        \r\n\r\n    \r\n\r\n        <script type=\"application/ld+json\">\r\n        [{\"@context\": \"http://schema.org\",\"@type\": \"ScreeningEvent\",\"name\": \"People’s Emergency Briefing\",\"startDate\": \"2026-09-02T19:00:00+01:00\",\"endDate\": \"2026-09-02T20:30:00+01:00\",\"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\"url\" : \"https://www.outsavvy.com/event/38449/peoples-emergency-briefing\",\"image\" : \"https://cdn.outsavvy.com/events/954dd33a-e7ad-4d85-a737-c7971a10495d.jpg\",\"eventStatus\" : \"http://schema.org/EventScheduled\",\"description\" : \"Feeling overwhelmed by climate change? Come hear how we can unf*ck the planet (no, you don’t have to go vegan).Want to connect with other queers? Queers mobilise.  We can make a difference.People’s Emergency Briefing is a 50-minute climate documentary based on a live briefing by climate experts for MPs in Westminster last year, featuring Jennifer Saunders. This film isn&#39;t available online or in cinemas, it&#39;s been created for community screenings (like this one); so far there have been over 700 grassroots screenings across the UK. More info here: https://www.nebriefing.org/ After the film is a discussion with Zo&#235; Garbett (Mayor of Hackney and UK&#39;s first directly elected Greens Party mayor) and Fiona Harvey (Environment Editor at The Guardian). Schedule:7.00pm - film screening7.50pm - panel and group discussion 8.30pm - close  \",\"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\",\"name\": \"The Common Press Dalston\",\"address\": { \"@type\" : \"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\" : \"The Common Press Dalston, 97 Stoke Newington Road\",\"addressLocality\" : \"London\",\"addressRegion\" : \"England\",\"postalCode\" : \"N16 8BX\" },\"geo\" : {\"@type\" : \"GeoCoordinates\", \"latitude\" : \"51.55443\", \"longitude\" : \"-0.0749814\"} },\"offers\": {\"@type\": \"AggregateOffer\", \"availability\":\"http://schema.org/BackOrder\", \"availabilityEnds\":\"2026-09-02T18:00:00+01:00\",\"priceCurrency\":\"GBP\",\"url\":\"https://www.outsavvy.com/event/38449/peoples-emergency-briefing\",\"lowPrice\":0,\"highPrice\":0,\"availabilityStarts\":\"2026-08-02T10:47:45+01:00\",\"validFrom\":\"2026-08-02T10:47:45+01:00\",\"offers\":[{\"availability\":\"http://schema.org/BackOrder\", \"availabilityEnds\":\"2026-09-02T18:00:00+01:00\",\"name\":\"Free entry\",\"priceCurrency\":\"GBP\",\"url\":\"https://www.outsavvy.com/event/38449/peoples-emergency-briefing\",\"price\":0,\"availabilityStarts\":\"2026-08-02T10:47:45+01:00\",\"validFrom\":\"2026-08-02T10:47:45+01:00\",\"@type\":\"Offer\"}]},\"organizer\" : { \"@type\" : \"Organization\", \"url\" : \"https://www.outsavvy.com/organiser/emelia-and-stav-b\", \"description\" : \"\", \"name\" : \"Emelia and Stav B\"}}]\r\n        </script>\r\n\r\n    \r\n\r\n    \r\n\r\n    <script type=\"text/javascript\">\r\n\r\n        window.addEventListener(\"load\", function () {\n\n            fetch(\"/Default.aspx/GetDoesLove\", {\n                method: \"POST\",\n                headers: {\n                    \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\"\n                },\n                body: JSON.stringify({\n                    eventId: 38449,\n                    userId: ''\n                })\n            })\n                .then(r => r.json())\n                .then(data => {\n\n                    const doesLove = data.d;\n\n                    if (doesLove) {\n                        document.body.classList.add(\"is-following\");\n                    }\n\n                });\n\n        });\r\n\r\n        window.addEventListener(\"load\", function () {\n\n            fetch(\"/Default.aspx/GetDoesFollowOrganiser\", {\n                method: \"POST\",\n                headers: {\n                    \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\"\n                },\n                body: JSON.stringify({\n                    eventPartnerid: 7786,\n                    userId: ''\n\n                })\n            })\n                .then(r => r.json())\n                .then(data => {\n\n                    const result = data.d;\n\n                    const button = document.querySelector(\".follow-organiser\");\n\n                    if (!button)\n                        return;\n\n                    if (result.CssClass.length > 0)\n                        button.classList.add(result.CssClass);\n\n                    const span = button.querySelector(\"span\");\n\n                    if (span)\n                        span.textContent = result.Text;\n\n                });\n\n        });\n\r\n\r\n        function followorganiser(eventpartnerid) {\r\n\r\n            const button = document.querySelector(\".follow-organiser\");\r\n\r\n            if (button.classList.contains(\"following-button\")) {\r\n                // Send the like to the service\r\n                $.ajax({\r\n                    type: \"POST\",\r\n                    contentType: \"application/json; charset=utf-8\",\r\n                    url: \"/Default.aspx/RemoveFollowOrganiser\",\r\n                    data: '{ userId: \"\", partnerId: \"' + eventpartnerid + '\" }',\r\n                    contentType: \"application/json; charset=utf-8\",\r\n                    dataType: \"json\",\r\n                    success: function (r) {\r\n                        if (r.d != 'undefined' && r.d != '' && r.d != null) {\r\n                            button.classList.remove(\"following-button\");\r\n                            const span = button.querySelector(\"span\");\n                            if (span)\n                                span.textContent = \"Follow\";\r\n         