              \r\n                            </div>\r\n                        </article>\r\n                    </a>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n    </div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"menu_footer_buttons\">\r\n                    <div class=\"nav-coll-links\">\r\n\r\n                        \r\n                        <a class=\"nav-coll-link\" href=\"/accountlogin\">Login</a>\r\n                        <a class=\"nav-coll-link\" href=\"/register\">Register</a>\r\n                        \r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <footer class=\"menu_footer\">\r\n\r\n                    <div id=\"footer-apps\">\r\n                        <div class=\"actions\">\r\n                            <a class=\"btn ui-gradient-green btn-app-store btn-download shadow-lg\" href=\"https://apps.apple.com/gb/app/outsavvy/id722344276\" target=\"_blank\"><span>Available on the</span> <span>App Store</span></a>\r\n                            <a class=\"btn ui-gradient-blue btn-google-play btn-download shadow-lg\" href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.outsavvyapp\" target=\"_blank\"><span>Available on </span><span>Google Play</span></a>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n\r\n                    <div class=\"menu_footer_links\">\r\n                        <a class=\"menu_footer_link\" href=\"/aboutus\">About</a>\r\n                        <a class=\"menu_footer_link\" href=\"/support\">Support</a>\r\n                        <a class=\"menu_footer_link\" href=\"/resell\">ReSell</a>\r\n                        <a class=\"menu_footer_link\" href=\"/contactus\">Contact</a>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </footer>\r\n\r\n            </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        \r\n\r\n    \r\n\r\n        <script type=\"application/ld+json\">\r\n        [{\"@context\": \"http://schema.org\",\"@type\": \"ScreeningEvent\",\"name\": \"Blackney Wick Film Club 003 - Blouse &amp; Skirt\",\"startDate\": \"2026-09-03T19:30:00+01:00\",\"endDate\": \"2026-09-03T23:00:00+01:00\",\"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\"url\" : \"https://www.outsavvy.com/event/38930/blackney-wick-film-club-003-blouse-skirt\",\"image\" : \"https://cdn.outsavvy.com/events/f20a3ace-0c08-4dae-837c-b2e12c192250.jpg\",\"eventStatus\" : \"http://schema.org/EventScheduled\",\"description\" : \"BLOUSE AND SKIRT.  Blackney Wick Film Club is back for the third edition of our residency at @alghasplantroom.Firstly, I want to give a big thanks to all those who attended our last edition, the conversations we shared after the film were super inspiring. It felt super healing and I can&#39;t wait to see you all again &#128155;&#128154;&#128420;After the madness of carnival, we want to use this edition to reflect on the Caribbean culture and how the diasporas have helped build culture in the UK.  So get ready for sound systems, bashment and dancehall. This is going to be a double screening. a documentary and film. All will be revealed on the night.Are you a filmmaker or an artist? Know one? Have any shorts that match the theme? Send it through ~ we’d love to show it before the main screenings. ‼️Trigger Warnings‼️This film contains themes of abuse, and violence.Blackney Wick Film Club was born out of the need for more sober spaces for our community to connect outside of the club. This is a POC oriented space, so allies, although you’re still welcome, please be mindful when in the space.✊&#127998;&#127903; Tickets  are on a sliding scale &#163;5 / &#163;10 / &#163;15 ~ please take a concession ticket only if you need it, and please take a pay it forward ticket if you are in a place of abundance. Ticket link is in the bio. We appreciate all support as a grassroots queer venue &#128154;If you can’t afford a ticket, drop us a message and we’d be happy to accommodate - @alghasplantroom on IG or email aliyah@plantroom.space\",\"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\",\"name\": \"algha&#39;s plantroom\",\"address\": { \"@type\" : \"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\" : \"algha&#39;s plantroom, 83 Smeed Road\",\"addressLocality\" : \"London\",\"addressRegion\" : \"England\",\"postalCode\" : \"E3 2NR\" },\"geo\" : {\"@type\" : \"GeoCoordinates\", \"latitude\" : \"51.53833\", \"longitude\" : \"-0.0234645\"} },\"offers\": {\"@type\": \"AggregateOffer\", \"availability\":\"http://schema.org/InStock\", \"availabilityEnds\":\"2026-09-03T18:30:00+01:00\",\"priceCurrency\":\"GBP\",\"url\":\"https://www.outsavvy.com/event/38930/blackney-wick-film-club-003-blouse-skirt\",\"lowPrice\":15,\"highPrice\":5,\"availabilityStarts\":\"2026-08-20T18:46:27+01:00\",\"validFrom\":\"2026-08-20T18:46:27+01:00\",\"offers\":[{\"availability\":\"http://schema.org/InStock\", \"availabilityEnds\":\"2026-09-03T18:30:00+01:00\",\"name\":\"Tier 1\",\"priceCurrency\":\"GBP\",\"url\":\"https://www.outsavvy.com/event/38930/blackney-wick-film-club-003-blouse-skirt\",\"price\":5,\"availabilityStarts\":\"2026-08-20T18:46:27+01:00\",\"validFrom\":\"2026-08-20T18:46:27+01:00\",\"@type\":\"Offer\"},{\"availability\":\"http://schema.org/InStock\", \"availabilityEnds\":\"2026-09-03T18:30:00+01:00\",\"name\":\"Tier 2\",\"priceCurrency\":\"GBP\",\"url\":\"https://www.outsavvy.com/event/38930/blackney-wick-film-club-003-blouse-skirt\",\"price\":10,\"availabilityStarts\":\"2026-08-20T18:46:27+01:00\",\"validFrom\":\"2026-08-20T18:46:27+01:00\",\"@type\":\"Offer\"},{\"availability\":\"http://schema.org/InStock\", \"availabilityEnds\":\"2026-09-03T18:30:00+01:00\",\"name\":\"Tier 3\",\"priceCurrency\":\"GBP\",\"url\":\"https://www.outsavvy.com/event/38930/blackney-wick-film-club-003-blouse-skirt\",\"price\":15,\"availabilityStarts\":\"2026-08-20T18:46:27+01:00\",\"validFrom\":\"2026-08-20T18:46:27+01:00\",\"@type\":\"Offer\"}]},\"organizer\" : { \"@type\" : \"Organization\", \"url\" : \"https://www.outsavvy.com/organiser/alghas-plantroom1\", \"description\" : \"algha&#39;s plantroom is a FLINTA-owned, queer led centre for experimental cultural programming. we are a proudly grassroots and community-led space based in fish island, hackney wick.\", \"name\" : \"Algha&#39;s Plantroom\"}}]\r\n        </script>\r\n\r\n    \r\n\r\n    \r\n\r\n    <script type=\"text/javascript\">\r\n\r\n        window.addEventListener(\"load\", function () {\n\n            fetch(\"/Default.aspx/GetDoesLove\", {\n                method: \"POST\",\n                headers: {\n                    \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\"\n                },\n                body: JSON.stringify({\n                    eventId: 38930,\n                    userId: ''\n                })\n            })\n                .then(r => r.json())\n                .then(data => {\n\n                    const doesLove = data.d;\n\n                    if (doesLove) {\n                        document.body.classList.add(\"is-following\");\n                    }\n\n                });\n\n        });\r\n\r\n        window.addEventListener(\"load\", function () {\n\n            fetch(\"/Default.aspx/GetDoesFollowOrganiser\", {\n                method: \"POST\",\n                headers: {\n                    \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\"\n                },\n                body: JSON.stringify({\n                    eventPartnerid: 7751,\n                    userId: ''\n\n                })\n            })\n                .then(r => r.json())\n                .then(data => {\n\n                    const result = data.d;\n\n                    const button = document.querySelector(\".follow-organiser\");\n\n                    if (!button)\n                        return;\n\n                    if (result.CssClass.length > 0)\n                        button.classList.add(result.CssClass);\n\n                    const span = button.querySelector(\"span\");\n\n                    if (span)\n                        span.textContent = result.Text;\n\n                });\n\n        });\n\r\n\r\n        function followorganiser(eventpartnerid) {\r\n\r\n            const button = document.querySelector(\".follow-organiser\");\r\n\r\n            if (button.classList.contains(\"following-button\")) {\r\n                // Send the like to the service\r\n                $.ajax({\r\n                    type: \"POST\",\r\n                    contentType: \"application/json; charset=utf-8\",\r\n                    url: \"/Default.aspx/RemoveFollowOrganiser\",\r\n                    data: '{ userId: \"\", partnerId: \"' + eventpartnerid + '\" }',\r\n                    contentType: \"application/json; charset=utf-8\",\r\n                    dataType: \"json\",\r\n                    success: function (r) {\r\n                        if (r.d != 'undefined' && r.d != '' && r.d != null) {\r\n                            button.classList.remove(\"following-button\");\r\n                            const span = button.querySelector(\"span\");\n                            if (span)\n                                span.textContent = \"Follow\";\r\n                        }\r\n                    },\r\n                    failure: function (r) {\r\n                    },\r\n                    error: function (r) {\r\n                    }\r\n                });\r\n            } else {\r\n                // Send the like to the service\r\n                $.ajax({\r\n                    type: \"POST\",\r\n                    contentType: \"application/json; charset=utf-8\",\r\n                    url: \"/Default.aspx/AddFollowOrganiser\",\r\n                    data: '{ userId: \"\", partnerId: \"' + eventpartnerid + '\" }',\r\n                    contentType: \"application/json; charset=utf-8\",\r\n                    dataType: \"json\",\r\n                    success: function (r) {\r\n                        if (r.d != 'undefined' && r.d != '' && r.d != null) {\r\n                            button.classList.add(\"following-button\");\r\n                            const span = button.querySelector(\"span\");\n                            if (span)\n                                span.textContent = \"Following\";\r\n                        }\r\n                    },\r\n                    failure: function (r) {\r\n                    },\r\n                    error: function (r) {\r\n                    }\r\n                });\r\n            }\r\n        }\r\n\r\n\r\n        function loveevent(eventid) {\r\n\r\n             \r\n            window.location.href = '/accountlogin?returnURL=/event/38930/blackney-wick-film-club-003-blouse-skirt';\r\n            return;\r\n                        \r\n\r\n            if (document.body.classList.contains('is-following')) {\r\n                // Send the like to the service\r\n                $.ajax({\r\n                    type: \"POST\",\r\n                    contentType: \"application/json; charset=utf-8\",\r\n                    url: \"/Default.aspx/RemoveEventLike\",\r\n                    data: '{ userId: \"\", eventId: \"' + eventid + '\" }',\r\n                    contentType: \"application/json; charset=utf-8\",\r\n                    dataType: \"json\",\r\n                    success: function (r) {\r\n                        if (r.d != 'undefined' && r.d != '' && r.d != null) {\r\n                            document.body.classList.remove(\"is-following\");\r\n                            $(\".hiddenLike\").hide();\r\n                        }\r\n                    },\r\n                    failure: function (r) {\r\n                    },\r\n                    error: function (r) {\r\n                    }\r\n                });\r\n            } else {\r\n                // Send the like to the service\r\n                $.ajax({\r\n                    type: \"POST\",\r\n                    contentType: \"application/json; charset=utf-8\",\r\n                    url: \"/Default.aspx/AddEventLike\",\r\n                    data: '{ userId: \"\", eventId: \"' + eventid + '\", isWebsite: true }',\r\n                    contentType: \"application/json; charset=utf-8\",\r\n                    dataType: \"json\",\r\n                    success: function (r) {\r\n                        if (r.d != 'undefined' && r.d != '' && r.d != null) {\r\n                            document.body.classList.add(\"is-following\");\r\n                            $(\".hiddenLike\").slideDown(\"slow\", function () {\r\n                                // Animation complete.\r\n                            });\r\n                        }\r\n                    },\r\n                    failure: function (r) {\r\n                    },\r\n                    error: function (r) {\r\n                    }\r\n                });\r\n            }\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        $(document).ready(function () {\r\n\r\n            let check = false;\r\n            (function (a) { if (/(android|bb\\d+|meego).+mobile|avantgo|bada\\/|blackberry|blazer|compal|elaine|fennec|hiptop|iemobile|ip(hone|od)|iris|kindle|lge |maemo|midp|mmp|mobile.+firefox|netfront|opera m(ob|in)i|palm( os)?|phone|p(ixi|re)\\/|plucker|pocket|psp|series(4|6)0|symbian|treo|up\\.(browser|link)|vodafone|wap|windows ce|xda|xiino/i.test(a) || /1207|6310|6590|3gso|4thp|50[1-6]i|770s|802s|a wa|abac|ac(er|oo|s\\-)|ai(ko|rn)|al(av|ca|co)|amoi|an(ex|ny|yw)|aptu|ar(ch|go)|as(te|us)|attw|au(di|\\-m|r |s )|avan|be(ck|ll|nq)|bi(lb|rd)|bl(ac|az)|br(e|v)w|bumb|bw\\-(n|u)|c55\\/|capi|ccwa|cdm\\-|cell|chtm|cldc|cmd\\-|co(mp|nd)|craw|da(it|ll|ng)|dbte|dc\\-s|devi|dica|dmob|do(c|p)o|ds(12|\\-d)|el(49|ai)|em(l2|ul)|er(ic|k0)|esl8|ez([4-7]0|os|wa|ze)|fetc|fly(\\-|_)|g1 u|g560|gene|gf\\-5|g\\-mo|go(\\.w|od)|gr(ad|un)|haie|hcit|hd\\-(m|p|t)|hei\\-|hi(pt|ta)|hp( i|ip)|hs\\-c|ht(c(\\-| |_|a|g|p|s|t)|tp)|hu(aw|tc)|i\\-(20|go|ma)|i230|iac( |\\-|\\/)|ibro|idea|ig01|ikom|im1k|inno|ipaq|iris|ja(t|v)a|jbro|jemu|jigs|kddi|kej