class=\"thumb-text-holder\">\r\n                                <h2 class=\"thumb-entry-title\">\r\n                                    Bank Holiday Monday with The D.E Experience\r\n                                </h2>\r\n                                \r\n                                <div class=\"banner-entry-location\">Royal Vauxhall Tavern - Monday 31st August 2026</div>\r\n                                \r\n                            </div>\r\n                        </article>\r\n                    </a>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n    </div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"menu_footer_buttons\">\r\n                    <div class=\"nav-coll-links\">\r\n\r\n                        \r\n                        <a class=\"nav-coll-link\" href=\"/accountlogin\">Login</a>\r\n                        <a class=\"nav-coll-link\" href=\"/register\">Register</a>\r\n                        \r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <footer class=\"menu_footer\">\r\n\r\n                    <div id=\"footer-apps\">\r\n                        <div class=\"actions\">\r\n                            <a class=\"btn ui-gradient-green btn-app-store btn-download shadow-lg\" href=\"https://apps.apple.com/gb/app/outsavvy/id722344276\" target=\"_blank\"><span>Available on the</span> <span>App Store</span></a>\r\n                            <a class=\"btn ui-gradient-blue btn-google-play btn-download shadow-lg\" href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.outsavvyapp\" target=\"_blank\"><span>Available on </span><span>Google Play</span></a>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n\r\n                    <div class=\"menu_footer_links\">\r\n                        <a class=\"menu_footer_link\" href=\"/aboutus\">About</a>\r\n                        <a class=\"menu_footer_link\" href=\"/support\">Support</a>\r\n                        <a class=\"menu_footer_link\" href=\"/resell\">ReSell</a>\r\n                        <a class=\"menu_footer_link\" href=\"/contactus\">Contact</a>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </footer>\r\n\r\n            </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        \r\n\r\n    \r\n\r\n        <script type=\"application/ld+json\">\r\n        [{\"@context\": \"http://schema.org\",\"@type\": \"ScreeningEvent\",\"name\": \"Programmers of Tomorrow fundraiser screening #1: Goodbye, Dragon Inn (2003)\",\"startDate\": \"2026-09-05T19:30:00+01:00\",\"endDate\": \"2026-09-05T21:30:00+01:00\",\"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\"url\" : \"https://www.outsavvy.com/event/38387/programmers-of-tomorrow-fundraiser-screening-1-goodbye-dragon-inn-2003\",\"image\" : \"https://cdn.outsavvy.com/events/adc992ac-7f5e-4973-88cd-484a1e689560.jpg\",\"eventStatus\" : \"http://schema.org/EventScheduled\",\"description\" : \"‘Did you know this theatre is haunted?’The Cinema of Tomorrow (F.K.A PEPCOT) presents the first of three screenings on the theme of ‘Movies at the Movies’. Goodbye, Dragon Inn (2003) is a beautiful, melancholic and quietly funny exploration of intimacy and isolation over the course of the last day at a closing picture palace in Taipei City, Taiwan. Director Tsai Ming-Liang, master of the slow and closely observed, mourns the loss of some of the sacred rituals of cinema going, from cruising to shelling peanuts in the dark.This is the first event (and therefore launch. ) of Programmers of Tomorrow (PoT): A season of workshops and screenings for the future of film exhibition. Consisting of two free workshops, three fundraiser screenings and a film festival all-dayer, PoT will spread knowledge about film programming, build community around the love of movies, and facilitate first timers to put on their first ever public screening.  Read more about it and how to get involved.This screening is a fundraiser for both PoT and its venue, the Cinema Museum. The Cinema Museum is currently raising money to buy its amazing building and cement its place as the living archive of London&#39;s cinema history. Doors will open at 6.30pm for drinks and snacks amidst the ephemera of cinemas past, showtime at 7.30pm. AccessThere is one step to get into the museum, and a lift to get into the screening hall.Accessible and all gender toilets available.Carers free, service dogs welcome.The film is in Mandarin, Taiwanese and Japanese with English subtitles.No one turned away for lack of funds. Please email us for a discounted or free ticket.If you have any other questions or requests do get in touch. cinemaoftomorrowldn@gmail.com\",\"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\",\"name\": \"The Cinema Museum\",\"address\": { \"@type\" : \"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\" : \"The Cinema Museum, 2 Dugard Way\",\"addressLocality\" : \"London\",\"addressRegion\" : \"England\",\"postalCode\" : \"SE11 4TH\" },\"geo\" : {\"@type\" : \"GeoCoordinates\", \"latitude\" : \"51.49229\", \"longitude\" : \"-0.1052203\"} },\"offers\": {\"@type\": \"AggregateOffer\", \"availability\":\"http://schema.org/InStock\", \"availabilityEnds\":\"2026-09-05T18:30:00+01:00\",\"priceCurrency\":\"GBP\",\"url\":\"https://www.outsavvy.com/event/38387/programmers-of-tomorrow-fundraiser-screening-1-goodbye-dragon-inn-2003\",\"lowPrice\":12,\"highPrice\":9,\"availabilityStarts\":\"2026-07-24T11:25:33+01:00\",\"validFrom\":\"2026-07-24T11:25:33+01:00\",\"offers\":[{\"availability\":\"http://schema.org/InStock\", \"availabilityEnds\":\"2026-09-05T18:30:00+01:00\",\"name\":\"Fundraiser Ticket\",\"priceCurrency\":\"GBP\",\"url\":\"https://www.outsavvy.com/event/38387/programmers-of-tomorrow-fundraiser-screening-1-goodbye-dragon-inn-2003\",\"price\":12,\"availabilityStarts\":\"2026-07-24T11:25:33+01:00\",\"validFrom\":\"2026-07-24T11:25:33+01:00\",\"@type\":\"Offer\"},{\"availability\":\"http://schema.org/InStock\", \"availabilityEnds\":\"2026-09-05T18:30:00+01:00\",\"name\":\"Standard Ticket\",\"priceCurrency\":\"GBP\",\"url\":\"https://www.outsavvy.com/event/38387/programmers-of-tomorrow-fundraiser-screening-1-goodbye-dragon-inn-2003\",\"price\":9,\"availabilityStarts\":\"2026-07-24T11:25:33+01:00\",\"validFrom\":\"2026-07-24T11:25:33+01:00\",\"@type\":\"Offer\"}]},\"organizer\" : { \"@type\" : \"Organization\", \"url\" : \"https://www.outsavvy.com/organiser/cinema-of-tomorrow\", \"description\" : \"The South London-based film club F.K.A. PEPCOT (Peckham Experimental Prototype Cinema of Tomorrow) is evolving into simply… The Cinema of Tomorrow, a microcinema in the making for South East London. \", \"name\" : \"Cinema of Tomorrow\"}}]\r\n        </script>\r\n\r\n    \r\n\r\n    \r\n\r\n    <script type=\"text/javascript\">\r\n\r\n        window.addEventListener(\"load\", function () {\n\n            fetch(\"/Default.aspx/GetDoesLove\", {\n                method: \"POST\",\n                headers: {\n                    \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\"\n                },\n                body: JSON.stringify({\n                    eventId: 38387,\n                    userId: ''\n                })\n            })\n                .then(r => r.json())\n                .then(data => {\n\n                    const doesLove = data.d;\n\n                    if (doesLove) {\n                        document.body.classList.add(\"is-following\");\n                    }\n\n                });\n\n        });\r\n\r\n        window.addEventListener(\"load\", function () {\n\n            fetch(\"/Default.aspx/GetDoesFollowOrganiser\", {\n                method: \"POST\",\n                headers: {\n                    \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\"\n                },\n                body: JSON.stringify({\n                    eventPartnerid: 7030,\n                    userId: ''\n\n                })\n            })\n                .then(r => r.json())\n                .then(data => {\n\n           