he D.E Experience\r\n                                </h2>\r\n                                \r\n                                <div class=\"banner-entry-location\">Royal Vauxhall Tavern - Monday 31st August 2026</div>\r\n                                \r\n                            </div>\r\n                        </article>\r\n                    </a>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n    </div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"menu_footer_buttons\">\r\n                    <div class=\"nav-coll-links\">\r\n\r\n                        \r\n                        <a class=\"nav-coll-link\" href=\"/accountlogin\">Login</a>\r\n                        <a class=\"nav-coll-link\" href=\"/register\">Register</a>\r\n                        \r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <footer class=\"menu_footer\">\r\n\r\n                    <div id=\"footer-apps\">\r\n                        <div class=\"actions\">\r\n                            <a class=\"btn ui-gradient-green btn-app-store btn-download shadow-lg\" href=\"https://apps.apple.com/gb/app/outsavvy/id722344276\" target=\"_blank\"><span>Available on the</span> <span>App Store</span></a>\r\n                            <a class=\"btn ui-gradient-blue btn-google-play btn-download shadow-lg\" href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.outsavvyapp\" target=\"_blank\"><span>Available on </span><span>Google Play</span></a>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n\r\n                    <div class=\"menu_footer_links\">\r\n                        <a class=\"menu_footer_link\" href=\"/aboutus\">About</a>\r\n                        <a class=\"menu_footer_link\" href=\"/support\">Support</a>\r\n                        <a class=\"menu_footer_link\" href=\"/resell\">ReSell</a>\r\n                        <a class=\"menu_footer_link\" href=\"/contactus\">Contact</a>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </footer>\r\n\r\n            </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        \r\n\r\n    \r\n\r\n        <script type=\"application/ld+json\">\r\n        [{\"@context\": \"http://schema.org\",\"@type\": \"ScreeningEvent\",\"name\": \"Jawbreaker 1999 film screening\",\"startDate\": \"2026-09-09T18:00:00+01:00\",\"endDate\": \"2026-09-09T21:30:00+01:00\",\"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\"url\" : \"https://www.outsavvy.com/event/38983/jawbreaker-1999-film-screening\",\"image\" : \"https://cdn.outsavvy.com/events/a8aa6cc8-ab02-44dd-ab51-96edbe1d7fb5.png\",\"eventStatus\" : \"http://schema.org/EventScheduled\",\"description\" : \"Fashion film club.  Come down the rabbit hole with us with a screening of 1999&#39;s Jawbreaker. Celebrating one of the most underrated films of the early 2000s. Jawbreaker starring fashion icon Rose McGowan directed by Darren SteinCostumes are designed by Vikki Barrett, who is responsible for the fashion moment Clueless so you know they are incredible. Synopsis: Three popular girls from high school accidentally kill their best friend on her birthday. As they conspire to cover up the murder, the ensuing police investigation turns their lives upside down.Fashion film club is created by Rosie Okotcha, spotlighting the costumes and creative impact of some of your fave films. Each evening begins with a gathering hour where guests can mingle, grab a drink, and connect before the film starts.Event Details:Doors: 6:00 PMFilm begins: 7:00PMYou are encouraged to dress inspired by the film Come solo or bring a friend &amp;lt;3\",\"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\",\"name\": \"Rhizomatic!\",\"address\": { \"@type\" : \"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\" : \"Rhizomatic!, 83 Smeed Road\",\"addressLocality\" : \"London\",\"addressRegion\" : \"England\",\"postalCode\" : \"E3 2NR\" },\"geo\" : {\"@type\" : \"GeoCoordinates\", \"latitude\" : \"51.53825\", \"longitude\" : \"-0.0234224\"} },\"offers\": {\"@type\": \"AggregateOffer\", \"availability\":\"http://schema.org/InStock\", \"availabilityEnds\":\"2026-09-09T17:00:00+01:00\",\"priceCurrency\":\"GBP\",\"url\":\"https://www.outsavvy.com/event/38983/jawbreaker-1999-film-screening\",\"lowPrice\":9,\"highPrice\":9,\"availabilityStarts\":\"2026-08-24T10:39:47+01:00\",\"validFrom\":\"2026-08-24T10:39:47+01:00\",\"offers\":[{\"availability\":\"http://schema.org/InStock\", \"availabilityEnds\":\"2026-09-09T17:00:00+01:00\",\"name\":\"General Admission\",\"priceCurrency\":\"GBP\",\"url\":\"https://www.outsavvy.com/event/38983/jawbreaker-1999-film-screening\",\"price\":9,\"availabilityStarts\":\"2026-08-24T10:39:47+01:00\",\"validFrom\":\"2026-08-24T10:39:47+01:00\",\"@type\":\"Offer\"}]},\"organizer\" : { \"@type\" : \"Organization\", \"url\" : \"https://www.outsavvy.com/organiser/fashion-film-club\", \"description\" : \"Come down the rabbit hole with us for a screening of some of the best and most underrated fashion films. Created by Rosie Okotcha, spotlighting the costumes and creative impact of some of your fave films. \", \"name\" : \"Fashion Film Club\"}}]\r\n        </script>\r\n\r\n    \r\n\r\n    \r\n\r\n    <script type=\"text/javascript\">\r\n\r\n        window.addEventListener(\"load\", function () {\n\n            fetch(\"/Default.aspx/GetDoesLove\", {\n                method: \"POST\",\n                headers: {\n                    \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\"\n                },\n                body: JSON.stringify({\n                    eventId: 38983,\n                    userId: ''\n                })\n            })\n                .then(r => r.json())\n                .then(data => {\n\n                    const doesLove = data.d;\n\n                    if (doesLove) {\n                        document.body.classList.add(\"is-following\");\n                    }\n\n                });\n\n        });\r\n\r\n        window.addEventListener(\"load\", function () {\n\n            fetch(\"/Default.aspx/GetDoesFollowOrganiser\", {\n                method: \"POST\",\n                headers: {\n                    \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\"\n                },\n                body: JSON.stringify({\n                    eventPartnerid: 7906,\n                    userId: ''\n\n                })\n            })\n                .then(r => r.json())\n                .then(data => {\n\n                    const result = data.d;\n\n                    const button = document.querySelector(\".follow-organiser\");\n\n                    if (!button)\n                        return;\n\n                    if (result.CssClass.length > 0)\n                        button.classList.add(result.CssClass);\n\n                    const span = button.querySelector(\"span\");\n\n                    if (span)\n                        span.textContent = result.Text;\n\n                });\n\n        });\n\r\n\r\n        function followorganiser(eventpartnerid) {\r\n\r\n            const button = document.querySelector(\".follow-organiser\");\r\n\r\n            if (button.classList.contains(\"following-button\")) {\r\n                // Send the like to the service\r\n                $.ajax({\r\n                    type: \"POST\",\r\n                    contentType: \"application/json; charset=utf-8\",\r\n                    url: \"/Default.aspx/RemoveFollowOrganiser\",\r\n                    data: '{ userId: \"\", partnerId: \"' + eventpartnerid + '\" }',\r\n                    contentType: \"application/json; charset=utf-8\",\r\n                    dataType: \"json\",\r\n                    success: function (r) {\r\n                        if (r.d != 'undefined' && r.d != '' && r.d != null) {\r\n                            button.classList.remove(\"following-button\");\r\n                            const span = button.querySelector(\"span\");\n                            if (span)\n                                span.textContent = \"Follow\";\r\n                        }\r\n                    },\r\n                    failure: function (r) {\r\n                    },\r\n                    error: function (r) {\r\n                    }\r\n                });\r\n            } else {\r\n                // Send the like to the service\r\n                $.ajax({\r\n                    type: \"POST\",\r\n                    contentType: \"application/json; charset=utf-8\",\r\n                    url: \"/Default.aspx/AddFollowOrganiser\",\r\n                    data: '{ userId: \"\", partnerId: \"' + eventpartnerid + '\" }',\r\n                    contentType: \"application/json; charset=utf-8\",\r\n                    dataType: \"json\",\r\n                    success: function (r) {\r\n                        if (r.d != 'undefined' && r.d != '' && r.d != null) {\r\n                            button.classList.add(\"following-button\");\r\n                            const span = button.querySelector(\"span\");\n                            if (span)\n                                span.textContent = \"Following\";\r\n                        }\r\n                    },\r\n                    failure: function (r) {\r\n                    },\r\n                    error: function (r) {\r\n                    }\r\n                });\r\n            }\r\n        }\r\n\r\n\r\n        function loveevent(eventid) {\r\n\r\n             \r\n            window.location.href = '/accountlogin?returnURL=/event/38983/jawbreaker-1999-film-screening';\r\n            return;\r\n                        \r\n\r\n            if (document.body.classList.contains('is-following')) {\r\n                // Send the like to the service\r\n                $.ajax({\r\n                    type: \"POST\",\r\n                    contentType: \"application/json; charset=utf-8\",\r\n                    url: \"/Default.aspx/RemoveEventLike\",\r\n                    data: '{ userId: \"\", eventId: \"' + eventid + '\" }',\r\n                    contentType: \"application/json; charset=utf-8\",\r\n                    dataType: \"json\",\r\n                    success: function (r) {\r\n                        if (r.d != 'undefined' && r.d != '' && r.d != null) {\r\n                            document.body.classList.remove(\"is-following\");\r\n                            $(\".hiddenLike\").hide();\r\n                        }\r\n                    },\r\n                    failure: function (r) {\r\n                    },\r\n                    error: function (r) {\r\n                    }\r\n                });\r\n            } else {\r\n                // Send the like to the service\r\n                $.ajax({\r\n                    type: \"POST\",\r\n                    contentType: \"application/json; charset=utf-8\",\r\n                    url: \"/Default.aspx/AddEventLike\",\r\n                    data: '{ userId: \"\", eventId: \"' + eventid + '\", isWebsite: true }',\r\n                    contentType: \"application/json; charset=utf-8\",\r\n                    dataType: \"json\",\r\n                    success: function (r) {\r\n                        if (r.d != 'undefined' && r.d != '' && r.d != null) {\r\n                            document.body.classList.add(\"is-following\");\r\n                            $(\".hiddenLike\").slideDown(\"slow\", function () {\r\n                                // Animation complete.\r\n                            });\r\n                        }\r\n                    },\r\n                    failure: function (r) {\r\n                    },\r\n                    error: function (r) {\r\n                    }\r\n                });\r\n            }\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        $(document).ready(function () {\r\n\r\n            let check = false;\r\n            (function (a) { if (/(android|bb\\d+|meego).+mobile|avantgo|bada\\/|blackberry|blazer|compal|elaine|fennec|hiptop|iemobile|ip(hone|od)|iris|kindle|lge |maemo|midp|mmp|mobile.