            "text": "\r\n\r\n<!DOCTYPE html>\r\n<!--[if lt IE 7]> \t\t\t\t<html xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" xml:lang=\"en\" lang=\"en\" class=\"ie ie6 lte9 lte8 lte7 \">\t<![endif]-->\r\n<!--[if IE 7]>\t\t\t\t\t<html xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" xml:lang=\"en\" lang=\"en\" class=\"ie ie7 lte9 lte8 lte7 \">\t<![endif]-->\r\n<!--[if IE 8]>\t\t\t\t\t<html xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" xml:lang=\"en\" lang=\"en\" class=\"ie ie8 lte9 lte8 \">\t\t<![endif]-->\r\n<!--[if IE 9]>\t\t\t\t\t<html xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" xml:lang=\"en\" lang=\"en\" class=\"ie ie9 lte9 \">\t\t\t\t<![endif]-->\r\n<!--[if (gt IE 9)|!(IE)]><!-->\r\n<html xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" xml:lang=\"en\" lang=\"en\">\r\n<!--<![endif]-->\r\n<head id=\"Head1\"><title>\r\n\tTRANSMISSIONS x DREAM EMULATOR PRESENT: eXistenZ ***VHS*** Tickets | 09 Sep @ Dalston Superstore, London | Pay What You Can to £5 | OutSavvy\r\n</title>\r\n\r\n    <script type=\"text/javascript\">\r\n        window.dataLayer = window.dataLayer || [];\r\n\r\n        function gtag() { dataLayer.push(arguments); }\r\n\r\n        if (window.location.hash ? window.location.hash == '#cs-scan' : false) {\r\n            gtag(\"consent\", \"default\", { ad_storage: \"granted\", ad_user_data: \"granted\", ad_personalization: \"granted\", analytics_storage: \"granted\", functionality_storage: \"granted\", personalization_storage: \"granted\", security_storage: \"granted\", wait_for_update: 500 });\r\n        }\r\n        else {\r\n            gtag(\"consent\", \"default\", {\r\n                ad_storage: \"denied\",\r\n                ad_user_data: \"denied\",\r\n                ad_personalization: \"denied\",\r\n                analytics_storage: \"denied\",\r\n                functionality_storage: \"granted\",\r\n                personalization_storage: \"granted\",\r\n                security_storage: \"granted\",\r\n                wait_for_update: 500,\r\n            });\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        gtag(\"set\", \"ads_data_redaction\", true);\r\n\r\n        gtag(\"set\", \"developer_id.dZTlmZj\", true);\r\n    </script>\r\n\r\n    <script async src=\"https://consent.studio/outsavvy.com/banner.js\"></script>\r\n\r\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"/combres.axd/siteCss/7fe0f610674626944167a99dcfa57a351cfe742a930afe976c016bb3f608223c5956cdd8ab3167f15d9b50a337b27eba0ccb8113b99bd5e19f1cee33041b1821/\"/><script type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"/combres.axd/siteJs/4ea27d3d3dfdcea6aa2256650964498a5d720acb896b38d1bcbc2a81e57470911dd600418c7f575901cd7b3741c1b3a433126ce5ab0a56f134539cecb5333ade/\"></script>\r\n\r\n    <meta name=\"Priority\" content=\"1.0\" />\r\n    <meta name=\"ChangeFrequency\" content=\"daily\" />\r\n\r\n    <meta http-equiv=\"last-modified\" name=\"LastModified\" content=\"2026-08-31\" />\r\n\r\n    \r\n    <meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow\" />\r\n    \r\n\r\n    <meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"A London institution, Dalston Superstore&#39;s weekly film night Transmissions joins forces once again with the distinguished pixel farmers at Dream Emulator (Silent Hill Rave) for a very special VHS presentation of David Cronenberg&#39;s seductive cyberpunk Thriller eXistenZ (1999).The team who brought you the Rio&#39;s late-night screening of Crimes of the Future (2022) in March are back with another career high from the Canadian auteur that dives into a sticky, characteristically perverse take on virtual reality gaming where guns with teeth for bullets and fleshy consoles mark an eerie landscape you&#39;ll never want to leave.Jennifer Jason Leigh, Jude Law, Ian Holm, and Willem Dafoe star in a film about the pleasures and perils of giving your mind over to digital playgrounds; harnessing the era&#39;s anxieties and lacing them with hybrid flesh-tech eroticism and a propulsive, slippery energy that makes it one of Cronenberg&#39;s most memorable works.Join us in the bowels of Dalston Superstore, then sit back, and breathe calmly.The game has already begun.  Unfortunately subtitles are unavailable due to the format.Seating is a mixture of benches, backed chairs, bar stools, and floor space, and is first come, first served.\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_GB\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:locale:alternate\" content=\"en_US\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"OutSavvy\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"TRANSMISSIONS x DREAM EMULATOR PRESENT: eXistenZ ***VHS*** Tickets - London - OutSavvy\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://www.outsavvy.com/event/39159/transmissions-x-dream-emulator-present-existenz-vhs\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:image:type\" content=\"image/jpg\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1200\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"584\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://cdn.outsavvy.com/events/b0f43b4a-652e-41a0-b3d0-0c850de1d0df.png\" />\r\n\r\n    <meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" />\r\n    <meta name=\"twitter:site\" content=\"@OutSavvy\" />\r\n    <meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"TRANSMISSIONS x DREAM EMULATOR PRESENT: eXistenZ ***VHS*** Tickets - London - OutSavvy\" />\r\n    <meta name=\"twitter:url\" content=\"https://www.outsavvy.com/event/39159/transmissions-x-dream-emulator-present-existenz-vhs\" />\r\n    <meta name=\"twitter:app:name:iphone\" content=\"OutSavvy\" />\r\n    <meta name=\"twitter:app:id:iphone\" content=\"722344276\" />\r\n    <meta name=\"twitter:image\" content=\"https://cdn.outsavvy.com/events/b0f43b4a-652e-41a0-b3d0-0c850de1d0df.png?width=1200\" />\r\n    <meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"A London institution, Dalston Superstore&#39;s weekly film night Transmissions joins forces once again with the distinguished pixel farmers at Dream Emulator (Silent Hill Rave) for a very special VHS presentation of David Cronenberg&#39;s seductive cyberpunk Thriller eXistenZ (1999).The team who brought you the Rio&#39;s late-night screening of Crimes of the Future (2022) in March are back with another career high from the Canadian auteur that dives into a sticky, characteristically perverse take on virtual reality gaming where guns with teeth for bullets and fleshy consoles mark an eerie landscape you&#39;ll never want to leave.Jennifer Jason Leigh, Jude Law, Ian Holm, and Willem Dafoe star in a film about the pleasures and perils of giving your mind over to digital playgrounds; harnessing the era&#39;s anxieties and lacing them with hybrid flesh-tech eroticism and a propulsive, slippery energy that makes it one of Cronenberg&#39;s most memorable works.Join us in the bowels of Dalston Superstore, then sit back, and breathe calmly.The game has already begun.  Unfortunately subtitles are unavailable due to the format.Seating is a mixture of benches, backed chairs, bar stools, and floor space, and is first come, first served.\" />\r\n\r\n    <link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://www.outsavvy.com/event/39159/transmissions-x-dream-emulator-present-existenz-vhs\" />\r\n\r\n    <meta name=\"description\" content=\"OutSavvy | TRANSMISSIONS x DREAM EMULATOR PRESENT: eXistenZ ***VHS*** | Wednesday 9th September 2026 @ Dalston Superstore | Pay What You Can to £5 | Find event and ticket information for TRANSMISSIONS\" />\r\n\r\n    <script type=\"text/javascript\">\r\n        $(document).ready(function () {\r\n\r\n            var cookieEnabled = navigator.cookieEnabled;\r\n\r\n            // When cookieEnabled flag is present and false then cookies are disabled.\r\n            if (cookieEnabled === false) {\r\n                window.location.replace(\"http://www.outsavvy.com\");\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            // try to set a test cookie if we can't see any cookies and we're using \r\n            // either a browser that doesn't support navigator.cookieEnabled\r\n         