          "content": {
            "mimeType": "text/html; charset=utf-8",
            "text": "\r\n\r\n<!DOCTYPE html>\r\n<!--[if lt IE 7]> \t\t\t\t<html xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" xml:lang=\"en\" lang=\"en\" class=\"ie ie6 lte9 lte8 lte7 \">\t<![endif]-->\r\n<!--[if IE 7]>\t\t\t\t\t<html xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" xml:lang=\"en\" lang=\"en\" class=\"ie ie7 lte9 lte8 lte7 \">\t<![endif]-->\r\n<!--[if IE 8]>\t\t\t\t\t<html xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" xml:lang=\"en\" lang=\"en\" class=\"ie ie8 lte9 lte8 \">\t\t<![endif]-->\r\n<!--[if IE 9]>\t\t\t\t\t<html xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" xml:lang=\"en\" lang=\"en\" class=\"ie ie9 lte9 \">\t\t\t\t<![endif]-->\r\n<!--[if (gt IE 9)|!(IE)]><!-->\r\n<html xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" xml:lang=\"en\" lang=\"en\">\r\n<!--<![endif]-->\r\n<head id=\"Head1\"><title>\r\n\tFringe! Presents: SPIRITUAL ARTIVISM EVERYDAY -- Art Workshop with J Triangular Tickets | 18 Sep @ Pelican House, London | £22 | OutSavvy\r\n</title>\r\n\r\n    <script type=\"text/javascript\">\r\n        window.dataLayer = window.dataLayer || [];\r\n\r\n        function gtag() { dataLayer.push(arguments); }\r\n\r\n        if (window.location.hash ? window.location.hash == '#cs-scan' : false) {\r\n            gtag(\"consent\", \"default\", { ad_storage: \"granted\", ad_user_data: \"granted\", ad_personalization: \"granted\", analytics_storage: \"granted\", functionality_storage: \"granted\", personalization_storage: \"granted\", security_storage: \"granted\", wait_for_update: 500 });\r\n        }\r\n        else {\r\n            gtag(\"consent\", \"default\", {\r\n                ad_storage: \"denied\",\r\n                ad_user_data: \"denied\",\r\n                ad_personalization: \"denied\",\r\n                analytics_storage: \"denied\",\r\n                functionality_storage: \"granted\",\r\n                personalization_storage: \"granted\",\r\n                security_storage: \"granted\",\r\n                wait_for_update: 500,\r\n            });\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        gtag(\"set\", \"ads_data_redaction\", true);\r\n\r\n        gtag(\"set\", \"developer_id.dZTlmZj\", true);\r\n    </script>\r\n\r\n    <script async src=\"https://consent.studio/outsavvy.com/banner.js\"></script>\r\n\r\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"/combres.axd/siteCss/7fe0f610674626944167a99dcfa57a351cfe742a930afe976c016bb3f608223c5956cdd8ab3167f15d9b50a337b27eba0ccb8113b99bd5e19f1cee33041b1821/\"/><script type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"/combres.axd/siteJs/4ea27d3d3dfdcea6aa2256650964498a5d720acb896b38d1bcbc2a81e57470911dd600418c7f575901cd7b3741c1b3a433126ce5ab0a56f134539cecb5333ade/\"></script>\r\n\r\n    <meta name=\"Priority\" content=\"1.0\" />\r\n    <meta name=\"ChangeFrequency\" content=\"daily\" />\r\n\r\n    <meta http-equiv=\"last-modified\" name=\"LastModified\" content=\"2026-08-26\" />\r\n\r\n    \r\n    <meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow\" />\r\n    \r\n\r\n    <meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Join Fringe.  Queer Film and Arts Fest and artivist J Triangular for a collaborative film art workshop  Directly from Taiwan arrives J Triangular, the NB Prince and spiritual artivist brings legendary queer artivism workshops for collective care, radical imagination, and unruly self-expression to London for the first timeDuring this 3-hour collective session, we create experimental audiovisual fragments through DIY exercises in movement, writing, performance, and camera work.  Inspired by experimental pedagogies of the body, image, and language from the Global South, and by survival techniques developed by trans and non-binary people across Abya Yala (South America), we work collectively with accessible technologies, everyday materials, movement, fiction, and radical imagination. The body becomes a living archive, a territory of memory, resistance, defense, and care. Together, we explore how expanded cinema and collective image-making can challenge dominant narratives and create space for stories, bodies, and imaginaries too often pushed to the margins. Drawing from Global South perspectives, human rights, spirituality, and embodied resistance, we use fiction as a political and affective force: a way to reclaim our images, transform experiences of structural violence, and imagine other ways of existing together. No previous experience is needed—only curiosity and a willingness to experiment. All the pieces become part of a collective short film: a living collage made from our bodies, voices, gestures, and visions, which will be edited by J after the festival. Scholarship Places:There will be three places reserved for scholarship applicants, please check out our instagram @fringefilmfest for further information.About the Artist: J Triangular (they/them/he/him) http://www.jtriangular.com/ Is a transmasculine, non-binary filmmaker, poet, curator, performer and spiritual artivist from Colombia, creating between Taiwan, Colombia and New York. Their fierce, collaborative practice builds queer and trans avant-garde collectives and film cooperatives across Taiwan, Japan, Vietnam, Thailand, Colombia, New York, and South Africa—creating spaces of experimentation where queer and trans lives become poetry and resistance. \" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_GB\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:locale:alternate\" content=\"en_US\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"OutSavvy\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Fringe! Presents: SPIRITUAL ARTIVISM EVERYDAY -- Art Workshop with J Triangular Tickets - London - OutSavvy\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://www.outsavvy.com/event/39069/fringe-presents-spiritual-artivism-everyday-art-workshop-with-j-triangular\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:image:type\" content=\"image/jpg\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1200\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"584\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://cdn.outsavvy.com/events/960e6ae0-1395-4e89-aa4b-90f72eb647fc.jpg\" />\r\n\r\n    <meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" />\r\n    <meta name=\"twitter:site\" content=\"@OutSavvy\" />\r\n    <meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"Fringe! Presents: SPIRITUAL ARTIVISM EVERYDAY -- Art Workshop with J Triangular Tickets - London - OutSavvy\" />\r\n    <meta name=\"twitter:url\" content=\"https://www.outsavvy.com/event/39069/fringe-presents-spiritual-artivism-everyday-art-workshop-with-j-triangular\" />\r\n    <meta name=\"twitter:app:name:iphone\" content=\"OutSavvy\" />\r\n    <meta name=\"twitter:app:id:iphone\" content=\"722344276\" />\r\n    <meta name=\"twitter:image\" content=\"https://cdn.outsavvy.com/events/960e6ae0-1395-4e89-aa4b-90f72eb647fc.jpg?width=1200\" />\r\n    <meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"Join Fringe.  Queer Film and Arts Fest and artivist J Triangular for a collaborative film art workshop  Directly from Taiwan arrives J Triangular, the NB Prince and spiritual artivist brings legendary queer artivism workshops for collective care, radical imagination, and unruly self-expression to London for the first timeDuring this 3-hour collective session, we create experimental audiovisual fragments through DIY exercises in movement, writing, performance, and camera work.  Inspired by experimental pedagogies of the body, image, and language from the Global South, and by survival techniques developed by trans and non-binary people across Abya Yala (South America), we work collectively with accessible technologies, everyday materials, movement, fiction, and radical imagination. The body becomes a living archive, a territory of memory, resistance, defense, and care. Together, we explore how expanded cinema and collective image-making can challenge dominant narratives and create space for stories, bodies, and imaginaries too often pushed to the margins. Drawing from Global South perspectives, human rights, spirituality, and embodied resistance, we use fiction as a political and affective force: a way to reclaim our images, transform experiences of structural violence, and imagine other ways of existing together. No previous experience is needed—only curiosity and a willingness to experiment. All the pieces become part of a collective short film: a living collage made from our bodies, voices, gestures, and visions, which will be edited by J after the festival. Scholarship Places:There will be three places reserved for scholarship applicants, please check out our instagram @fringefilmfest for further information.About the Artist: J Triangular (they/them/he/him) http://www.jtriangular.com/ Is a transmasculine, non-binary filmmaker, poet, curator, performer and spiritual artivist from Colombia, creating between Taiwan, Colombia and New York. Their fierce, collaborative practice builds queer and trans avant-garde collectives and film cooperatives across Taiwan, Japan, Vietnam, Thailand, Colombia, New York, and South Africa—creating spaces of experimentation where queer and trans lives become poetry and resistance. \" />\r\n\r\n    <link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://www.outsavvy.com/event/39069/fringe-presents-spiritual-artivism-everyday-art-workshop-with-j-triangular\" />\r\n\r\n    <meta name=\"description\" content=\"OutSavvy | Fringe! Presents: SPIRITUAL ARTIVISM EVERYDAY -- Art Workshop with J Triangular | Friday 18th September 2026 @ Pelican House | £22 | Find event and ticket information for Fringe! Queer Film &amp; Arts Fest\" />\r\n\r\n    <script type=\"text/javascript\">\r\n        $(document).ready(function () {\r\n\r\n            var cookieEnabled = navigator.cookieEnabled;\r\n\r\n            // When cookieEnabled flag is present and false then cookies are disabled.\r\n            if (cookieEnabled === false) {\r\n                window.location.replace(\"http://www.outsavvy.com\");\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            // try to set a test cookie if we can't see any cookies and we're using \r\n            // either a browser that doesn't support navigator.cookieEnabled\r\n            // or IE (which always returns true for navigator.cookieEnabled)\r\n            if (!document.cookie && (cookieEnabled === null || /*@cc_on!@*/false)) {\r\n                document.cookie = \"testcookie=1\";\r\n\r\n                if (!document.cookie) {\r\n                    window.location.replace(\"http://www.outsavvy.com\");\r\n                } else {\r\n                    document.cookie = \"testcookie=; expires=\" + new Date(0).toUTCString();\r\n                }\r\n            }\r\n\r\n        });\r\n\r\n        function toggleShowPassword(clientId) {\r\n            let x = document.getElementById(clientId);\r\n            if (x.type === \"password\") {\r\n                x.type = \"text\";\r\n            } else {\r\n                x.type = \"password\";\r\n            }\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        function showShareModal() {\r\n            $('#shareModal').reveal({\r\n                animation: 'fadeAndPop',                   //fade, fadeAndPop, none\r\n                animationspseeed: 300,                       //how fast animtions are\r\n                closeonbackgroundclick: true,              //if you click background will modal close?\r\n                dismissmodalclass: 'close-reveal-modal'    //the class of a button or element that will close an open modal\r\n            });\r\n        }\r\n\r\n    </script>\r\n\r\n<link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" sizes=\"57x57\" href=\"https://cdn.outsavvy.com/website/favicon/apple-icon-57x57.png\" /><link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" sizes=\"60x60\" href=\"https://cdn.outsavvy.com/website/favicon/apple-icon-60x60.png\" /><link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" sizes=\"72x72\" href=\"https://cdn.outsavvy.com/website/favicon/apple-icon-72x72.png\" /><link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" sizes=\"76x76\" href=\"https://cdn.outsavvy.com/website/favicon/apple-icon-76x76.png\" /><link rel=\"apple-touc