        </h4>\r\n                            </a>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                        \r\n                    </div>\r\n\r\n                    \r\n\r\n<div class=\"nav-advert\">\r\n    <div id=\"eventscontent\" class=\"module-box row\">\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"newspanel\" id=\"tab-all\" style=\"display: block;\">\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"row row-16\">\r\n                <div class=\"col-lg-12 col-md-12 col-sm-12 col-xs-12\">\r\n                    <a href=\"/event/38362/bank-holiday-monday-with-the-de-experience\" aria-label=\"Bank Holiday Monday with The D.E Experience\">\r\n                        <article class=\"entry\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">\r\n                            <div class=\"thumb-bg-holder entry__bg-img-holder\">\r\n                                \r\n                                <div class=\"feature-price\">Tickets Off Sale</div>\r\n                                \r\n                                <img class=\"lazy\" src='https://cdn.outsavvy.com/website/preloader.jpg' data-src=\"https://cdn.outsavvy.com/bannerimage/5a9f93bd-91f8-46b9-a54a-563b5dd5009b.jpg\" alt=\"Bank Holiday Monday with The D.E Experience\" />\r\n                                <div class=\"bottom-gradient\"></div>\r\n                            </div>\r\n                            <div class=\"thumb-text-holder\">\r\n                                <h2 class=\"thumb-entry-title\">\r\n                                    Bank Holiday Monday with The D.E Experience\r\n                                </h2>\r\n                                \r\n                                <div class=\"banner-entry-location\">Royal Vauxhall Tavern - Monday 31st August 2026</div>\r\n                                \r\n                            </div>\r\n                        </article>\r\n                    </a>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n    </div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"menu_footer_buttons\">\r\n                    <div class=\"nav-coll-links\">\r\n\r\n                        \r\n                        <a class=\"nav-coll-link\" href=\"/accountlogin\">Login</a>\r\n                        <a class=\"nav-coll-link\" href=\"/register\">Register</a>\r\n                        \r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <footer class=\"menu_footer\">\r\n\r\n                    <div id=\"footer-apps\">\r\n                        <div class=\"actions\">\r\n                            <a class=\"btn ui-gradient-green btn-app-store btn-download shadow-lg\" href=\"https://apps.apple.com/gb/app/outsavvy/id722344276\" target=\"_blank\"><span>Available on the</span> <span>App Store</span></a>\r\n                            <a class=\"btn ui-gradient-blue btn-google-play btn-download shadow-lg\" href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.outsavvyapp\" target=\"_blank\"><span>Available on </span><span>Google Play</span></a>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n\r\n                    <div class=\"menu_footer_links\">\r\n                        <a class=\"menu_footer_link\" href=\"/aboutus\">About</a>\r\n                        <a class=\"menu_footer_link\" href=\"/support\">Support</a>\r\n                        <a class=\"menu_footer_link\" href=\"/resell\">ReSell</a>\r\n                        <a class=\"menu_footer_link\" href=\"/contactus\">Contact</a>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </footer>\r\n\r\n            </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        \r\n\r\n    \r\n\r\n        <script type=\"application/ld+json\">\r\n        [{\"@context\": \"http://schema.org\",\"@type\": \"ScreeningEvent\",\"name\": \"Fringe! Presents: SPIRITUAL ARTIVISM EVERYDAY -- Art Workshop with J Triangular\",\"startDate\": \"2026-09-18T15:00:00+01:00\",\"endDate\": \"2026-09-18T18:00:00+01:00\",\"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\"url\" : \"https://www.outsavvy.com/event/39069/fringe-presents-spiritual-artivism-everyday-art-workshop-with-j-triangular\",\"image\" : \"https://cdn.outsavvy.com/events/960e6ae0-1395-4e89-aa4b-90f72eb647fc.jpg\",\"eventStatus\" : \"http://schema.org/EventScheduled\",\"description\" : \"Join Fringe.  Queer Film and Arts Fest and artivist J Triangular for a collaborative film art workshop  Directly from Taiwan arrives J Triangular, the NB Prince and spiritual artivist brings legendary queer artivism workshops for collective care, radical imagination, and unruly self-expression to London for the first timeDuring this 3-hour collective session, we create experimental audiovisual fragments through DIY exercises in movement, writing, performance, and camera work.  Inspired by experimental pedagogies of the body, image, and language from the Global South, and by survival techniques developed by trans and non-binary people across Abya Yala (South America), we work collectively with accessible technologies, everyday materials, movement, fiction, and radical imagination. The body becomes a living archive, a territory of memory, resistance, defense, and care. Together, we explore how expanded cinema and collective image-making can challenge dominant narratives and create space for stories, bodies, and imaginaries too often pushed to the margins. Drawing from Global South perspectives, human rights, spirituality, and embodied resistance, we use fiction as a political and affective force: a way to reclaim our images, transform experiences of structural violence, and imagine other ways of existing together. No previous experience is needed—only curiosity and a willingness to experiment. All the pieces become part of a collective short film: a living collage made from our bodies, voices, gestures, and visions, which will be edited by J after the festival. Scholarship Places:There will be three places reserved for scholarship applicants, please check out our instagram @fringefilmfest for further information.About the Artist: J Triangular (they/them/he/him) http://www.jtriangular.com/ Is a transmasculine, non-binary filmmaker, poet, curator, performer and spiritual artivist from Colombia, creating between Taiwan, Colombia and New York. Their fierce, collaborative practice builds queer and trans avant-garde collectives and film cooperatives across Taiwan, Japan, Vietnam, Thailand, Colombia, New York, and South Africa—creating spaces of experimentation where queer and trans lives become poetry and resistance. \",\"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\",\"name\": \"Pelican House\",\"address\": { \"@type\" : \"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\" : \"Pelican House, 144 Cambridge Heath Road\",\"addressLocality\" : \"London\",\"addressRegion\" : \"England\",\"postalCode\" : \"E1 5QJ\" },\"geo\" : {\"@type\" : \"GeoCoordinates\", \"latitude\" : \"51.52415\", \"longitude\" : \"-0.0547129\"} },\"offers\": {\"@type\": \"AggregateOffer\", \"availability\":\"http://schema.org/InStock\", \"availabilityEnds\":\"2026-09-18T14:00:00+01:00\",\"priceCurrency\":\"GBP\",\"url\":\"https://www.outsavvy.com/event/39069/fringe-presents-spiritual-artivism-everyday-art-workshop-with-j-triangular\",\"lowPrice\":22,\"highPrice\":22,\"availabilityStarts\":\"2026-08-26T14:00:11+01:00\",\"validFrom\":\"2026-08-26T14:00:11+01:00\",\"offers\":[{\"availability\":\"http://schema.org/InStock\", \"availabilityEnds\":\"2026-09-18T14:00:00+01:00\",\"name\":\"General Admission\",\"priceCurrency\":\"GBP\",\"url\":\"https://www.outsavvy.com/event/39069/fringe-presents-spiritual-artivism-everyday-art-workshop-with-j-triangular\",\"price\":22,\"availabilityStarts\":\"2026-08-26T14:00:11+01:00\",\"validFrom\":\"2026-08-26T14:00:11+01:00\",\"@type\":\"Offer\"}]},\"organizer\" : { \"@type\" : \"Organization\", \"url\" : \"https://www.outsavvy.com/organiser/fringe\", \"description\" : \"Fringe.  is a film and arts festival rooted in London&#39;s queer creative scene and welcoming everyone. We&#39;re not-for-profit and run by a team of passionate volunteers. From feature films to experimental art, workshops to talks and wild parties to tickle every one of the senses. With our signature blend of eye opening movies, DIY and experimental work, the thoughtful, the provocative and the strange.Fringe.  Fest was launched in 2011, by a group of queer creatives as a community response to arts cuts carnage. Our mission is to offer a dynamic, representative and unmistakably fresh alternative to other film and arts festivals.\", \"name\" : \"Fringe! Queer Film &amp; Arts Fest\"}}]\r\n        </script>\r\n\r\n    \r\n\r\n    \r\n\r\n    <script type=\"text/javascript\">\r\n\r\n        window.addEventListener(\"load\", function () {\n\n            fetch(\"/Default.aspx/GetDoesLove\", {\n                method: \"POST\",\n                headers: {\n                    \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\"\n                },\n                body: JSON.stringify({\n                    eventId: 39069,\n                    userId: ''\n                })\n            })\n                .then(r => r.json())\n                .then(data => {\n\n                    const doesLove = data.d;\n\n                    if (doesLove) {\n                        document.body.classList.add(\"is-following\");\n                    }\n\n                });\n\n        });\r\n\r\n        window.addEventListener(\"load\", function () {\n\n            fetch(\"/Default.aspx/GetDoesFollowOrganiser\", {\n                method: \"POST\",\n                headers: {\n                    \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\"\n                },\n                body: JSON.stringify({\n                    eventPartnerid: 27,\n                    userId: ''\n\n                })\n            })\n                .then(r => r.json())\n                .then(data => {\n\n                    const result = data.d;\n\n                    const button = document.querySelector(\".follow-organiser\");\n\n                    if (!button)\n                        return;\n\n                    if (result.CssClass.length > 0)\n                        button.classList.add(result.CssClass);\n\n                    const span = button.querySelector(\"span\");\n\n                    if (span)\n                        span.textContent = result.Text;\n\n                });\n\n        });\n\r\n\r\n        function followorganiser(eventpartnerid) {\r\n\r\n            const button = document.querySelector(\".follow-organiser\");\r\n\r\n            if (button.classList.contains(\"following-button\")) {\r\n                // Send the like to the service\r\n                $.ajax({\r\n                    type: \"POST\",\r\n                    contentType: \"application/json; charset=utf-8\",\r\n                    url: \"/Default.aspx/RemoveFollowOrganiser\",\r\n                    data: '{ userId: \"\", partnerId: \"' + eventpartnerid + '\" }',\r\n                    contentType: \"application/json; charset=utf-8\",\r\n                    dataType: \"json\",\r\n                    success: function (r) {\r\n                        if (r.d != 'undefined' && r.d != '' && r.d != null) {\r\n                            button.classList.remove(\"following-button\");\r\n                            const span = button.querySelector(\"span\");\n                            if (span)\n                                span.textContent = \"Follow\";\r\n                        }\r\n                    },\r\n                    failure: function (r) {\r\n                    },\r\n                    error: function (r) {\r\n                    }\r\n                });\r\n            } else {\r\n                // Send the like to the service\r\n                $.ajax({\r\n                    type: \"POST\",\r\n                    contentType: \"application/json; charset=utf-8\",\r\n                    url: \"/Default.aspx/AddFollowOrganiser\",\r\n                    data: '{ userId: \"\", partnerId: \"' + eventpartnerid + '\" }',\r\n                    contentType: \"application/json; charset=utf-8\",\r\n                    dataType: \"json\",\r\n                    success: function (r) {\r\n                        if (r.d != 'undefined' && r.d != '' && r.d != null) {\r\n                            button.classList.add(\"following-button\");\r\n                            const span = button.querySelector(\"span\");\n                            if (span)\n                                span.textContent = \"Following\";\r\n                        }\r\n                    },\r\n                    failure: function (r) {\r\n                    },\r\n                    error: function (r) {\r\n                    }\r\n                });\r\n            }\r\n        }\r\n\r\n\r\n        function loveevent(eventid) {\r\n\r\n             \r\n            window.location.href = '/accountlogin?returnURL=/event/39069/fringe-presents-spiritual-artivism-everyday-art-workshop-with-j-triangular';\r\n            return;\r\n                        \r\n\r\n            if (document.body.classList.contains('is-following')) {\r\n                // Send the like to the service\r\n                $.ajax({\r\n                    type: \"POST\",\r\n                    contentType: \"application/json; charset=utf-8\",\r\n                    url: \"/Default.aspx/RemoveEventLike\",\r\n                    data: '{ userId: \"\", eventId: \"' + eventid + '\" }',\r\n                    contentType: \"application/json; charset=utf-8\",\r\n                    dataType: \"json\",\r\n                    success: function (r) {\r\n                        if (r.d != 'undefined' && r.d != '' && r.d != null) {\r\n                            document.body.classList.remove(\"is-following\");\r\n                            $(\".hiddenLike\").hide();\r\n                        }\r\n                    },\r\n                    failure: function (r) {\r\n      