          "content": {
            "mimeType": "text/html; charset=utf-8",
            "text": "\r\n\r\n<!DOCTYPE html>\r\n<!--[if lt IE 7]> \t\t\t\t<html xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" xml:lang=\"en\" lang=\"en\" class=\"ie ie6 lte9 lte8 lte7 \">\t<![endif]-->\r\n<!--[if IE 7]>\t\t\t\t\t<html xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" xml:lang=\"en\" lang=\"en\" class=\"ie ie7 lte9 lte8 lte7 \">\t<![endif]-->\r\n<!--[if IE 8]>\t\t\t\t\t<html xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" xml:lang=\"en\" lang=\"en\" class=\"ie ie8 lte9 lte8 \">\t\t<![endif]-->\r\n<!--[if IE 9]>\t\t\t\t\t<html xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" xml:lang=\"en\" lang=\"en\" class=\"ie ie9 lte9 \">\t\t\t\t<![endif]-->\r\n<!--[if (gt IE 9)|!(IE)]><!-->\r\n<html xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" xml:lang=\"en\" lang=\"en\">\r\n<!--<![endif]-->\r\n<head id=\"Head1\"><title>\r\n\tEverybody to Kenmure Street - Community Screening with Lewisham Anti Raids Tickets | 21 Sep @ Piehouse Co-Op, London | Pay What You Can | OutSavvy\r\n</title>\r\n\r\n    <script type=\"text/javascript\">\r\n        window.dataLayer = window.dataLayer || [];\r\n\r\n        function gtag() { dataLayer.push(arguments); }\r\n\r\n        if (window.location.hash ? window.location.hash == '#cs-scan' : false) {\r\n            gtag(\"consent\", \"default\", { ad_storage: \"granted\", ad_user_data: \"granted\", ad_personalization: \"granted\", analytics_storage: \"granted\", functionality_storage: \"granted\", personalization_storage: \"granted\", security_storage: \"granted\", wait_for_update: 500 });\r\n        }\r\n        else {\r\n            gtag(\"consent\", \"default\", {\r\n                ad_storage: \"denied\",\r\n                ad_user_data: \"denied\",\r\n                ad_personalization: \"denied\",\r\n                analytics_storage: \"denied\",\r\n                functionality_storage: \"granted\",\r\n                personalization_storage: \"granted\",\r\n                security_storage: \"granted\",\r\n                wait_for_update: 500,\r\n            });\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        gtag(\"set\", \"ads_data_redaction\", true);\r\n\r\n        gtag(\"set\", \"developer_id.dZTlmZj\", true);\r\n    </script>\r\n\r\n    <script async src=\"https://consent.studio/outsavvy.com/banner.js\"></script>\r\n\r\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"/combres.axd/siteCss/7fe0f610674626944167a99dcfa57a351cfe742a930afe976c016bb3f608223c5956cdd8ab3167f15d9b50a337b27eba0ccb8113b99bd5e19f1cee33041b1821/\"/><script type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"/combres.axd/siteJs/4ea27d3d3dfdcea6aa2256650964498a5d720acb896b38d1bcbc2a81e57470911dd600418c7f575901cd7b3741c1b3a433126ce5ab0a56f134539cecb5333ade/\"></script>\r\n\r\n    <meta name=\"Priority\" content=\"1.0\" />\r\n    <meta name=\"ChangeFrequency\" content=\"daily\" />\r\n\r\n    <meta http-equiv=\"last-modified\" name=\"LastModified\" content=\"2026-08-27\" />\r\n\r\n    \r\n    <meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow\" />\r\n    \r\n\r\n    <meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"In May 2021, a UK Home Office dawn raid triggers one of the most spontaneous and successful acts of civil resistance in recent memory. In Pollokshields, Scotland’s most diverse neighbourhood, hundreds of residents rush to the streets to stop the deportation of their neighbours. In today’s increasingly far-right political environment of immigration raids, deportation flights and border violence, Everybody to Kenmure Street is an empowering reminder of the importance of collective action. The screening will be followed by a casual chat with Lewisham Anti Raids @lewisham_anti_raids on the organising they do in the area, and how you can get involved. All are welcome, no matter your organising experience.  The film is rated 12A. Pay What You Can tickets are available from &#163;1-8. This event is part of a series of community screenings around London with local anti raids groups, organised by april forrest lin 林森. All ticket revenue will be donated to Lewisham Anti Raids after event costs have been covered. 18:30 - Doors open19:00 - Film screening20:45 - Chat with Lewisham Anti Raids21:00 - Chat ends, space stays open21:30 - Event ends\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_GB\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:locale:alternate\" content=\"en_US\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"OutSavvy\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Everybody to Kenmure Street - Community Screening with Lewisham Anti Raids Tickets - London - OutSavvy\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://www.outsavvy.com/event/38278/everybody-to-kenmure-street-community-screening-with-lewisham-anti-raids\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:image:type\" content=\"image/jpg\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1200\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"584\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://cdn.outsavvy.com/events/984be1b5-a6c3-4d19-b42b-a19d638eb4b2.jpg\" />\r\n\r\n    <meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" />\r\n    <meta name=\"twitter:site\" content=\"@OutSavvy\" />\r\n    <meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"Everybody to Kenmure Street - Community Screening with Lewisham Anti Raids Tickets - London - OutSavvy\" />\r\n    <meta name=\"twitter:url\" content=\"https://www.outsavvy.com/event/38278/everybody-to-kenmure-street-community-screening-with-lewisham-anti-raids\" />\r\n    <meta name=\"twitter:app:name:iphone\" content=\"OutSavvy\" />\r\n    <meta name=\"twitter:app:id:iphone\" content=\"722344276\" />\r\n    <meta name=\"twitter:image\" content=\"https://cdn.outsavvy.com/events/984be1b5-a6c3-4d19-b42b-a19d638eb4b2.jpg?width=1200\" />\r\n    <meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"In May 2021, a UK Home Office dawn raid triggers one of the most spontaneous and successful acts of civil resistance in recent memory. In Pollokshields, Scotland’s most diverse neighbourhood, hundreds of residents rush t