ust 2026</div>\r\n                                \r\n                            </div>\r\n                        </article>\r\n                    </a>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n    </div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"menu_footer_buttons\">\r\n                    <div class=\"nav-coll-links\">\r\n\r\n                        \r\n                        <a class=\"nav-coll-link\" href=\"/accountlogin\">Login</a>\r\n                        <a class=\"nav-coll-link\" href=\"/register\">Register</a>\r\n                        \r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <footer class=\"menu_footer\">\r\n\r\n                    <div id=\"footer-apps\">\r\n                        <div class=\"actions\">\r\n                            <a class=\"btn ui-gradient-green btn-app-store btn-download shadow-lg\" href=\"https://apps.apple.com/gb/app/outsavvy/id722344276\" target=\"_blank\"><span>Available on the</span> <span>App Store</span></a>\r\n                            <a class=\"btn ui-gradient-blue btn-google-play btn-download shadow-lg\" href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.outsavvyapp\" target=\"_blank\"><span>Available on </span><span>Google Play</span></a>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n\r\n                    <div class=\"menu_footer_links\">\r\n                        <a class=\"menu_footer_link\" href=\"/aboutus\">About</a>\r\n                        <a class=\"menu_footer_link\" href=\"/support\">Support</a>\r\n                        <a class=\"menu_footer_link\" href=\"/resell\">ReSell</a>\r\n                        <a class=\"menu_footer_link\" href=\"/contactus\">Contact</a>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </footer>\r\n\r\n            </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        \r\n\r\n    \r\n\r\n        <script type=\"application/ld+json\">\r\n        [{\"@context\": \"http://schema.org\",\"@type\": \"ScreeningEvent\",\"name\": \"Everybody to Kenmure Street - Community Screening with Lewisham Anti Raids\",\"startDate\": \"2026-09-21T18:30:00+01:00\",\"endDate\": \"2026-09-21T21:30:00+01:00\",\"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\"url\" : \"https://www.outsavvy.com/event/38278/everybody-to-kenmure-street-community-screening-with-lewisham-anti-raids\",\"image\" : \"https://cdn.outsavvy.com/events/984be1b5-a6c3-4d19-b42b-a19d638eb4b2.jpg\",\"eventStatus\" : \"http://schema.org/EventScheduled\",\"description\" : \"In May 2021, a UK Home Office dawn raid triggers one of the most spontaneous and successful acts of civil resistance in recent memory. In Pollokshields, Scotland’s most diverse neighbourhood, hundreds of residents rush to the streets to stop the deportation of their neighbours. In today’s increasingly far-right political environment of immigration raids, deportation flights and border violence, Everybody to Kenmure Street is an empowering reminder of the importance of collective action. The screening will be followed by a casual chat with Lewisham Anti Raids @lewisham_anti_raids on the organising they do in the area, and how you can get involved. All are welcome, no matter your organising experience.  The film is rated 12A. Pay What You Can tickets are available from &#163;1-8. This event is part of a series of community screenings around London with local anti raids groups, organised by april forrest lin 林森. All ticket revenue will be donated to Lewisham Anti Raids after event costs have been covered. 18:30 - Doors open19:00 - Film screening20:45 - Chat with Lewisham Anti Raids21:00 - Chat ends, space stays open21:30 - Event ends\",\"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\",\"name\": \"Piehouse Co-Op\",\"address\": { \"@type\" : \"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\" : \"Piehouse Co-Op, 213-214 Edward Place\",\"addressLocality\" : \"London\",\"addressRegion\" : \"England\",\"postalCode\" : \"SE8 5HD\" },\"geo\" : {\"@type\" : \"GeoCoordinates\", \"latitude\" : \"51.48091\", \"longitude\" : \"-0.0317343\"} },\"offers\": {\"@type\": \"AggregateOffer\", \"availability\":\"http://schema.org/InStock\", \"availabilityEnds\":\"2026-09-21T18:00:00+01:00\",\"priceCurrency\":\"GBP\",\"url\":\"https://www.outsavvy.com/event/38278/everybody-to-kenmure-street-community-screening-with-lewisham-anti-raids\",\"lowPrice\":0,\"highPrice\":0,\"availabilityStarts\":\"2026-07-27T11:53:37+01:00\",\"validFrom\":\"2026-07-27T11:53:37+01:00\",\"offers\":[{\"availability\":\"http://schema.org/InStock\", \"availabilityEnds\":\"2026-09-21T18:00:00+01:00\",\"name\":\"Pay What You Can\",\"priceCurrency\":\"GBP\",\"url\":\"https://www.outsavvy.com/event/38278/everybody-to-kenmure-street-community-screening-with-lewisham-anti-raids\",\"price\":0,\"availabilityStarts\":\"2026-07-27T11:53:37+01:00\",\"validFrom\":\"2026-07-27T11:53:37+01:00\",\"@type\":\"Offer\"}]},\"organizer\" : { \"@type\" : \"Organization\", \"url\" : \"https://www.outsavvy.com/organiser/april-forrest-lin-\", \"description\" : \"\", \"name\" : \"april forrest lin 林森\"}}]\r\n        </script>\r\n\r\n    \r\n\r\n    \r\n\r\n    <script type=\"text/javascript\">\r\n\r\n        window.addEventListener(\"load\", function () {\n\n            fetch(\"/Default.aspx/GetDoesLove\", {\n                method: \"POST\",\n                headers: {\n                    \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\"\n                },\n                body: JSON.stringify({\n                    eventId: 38278,\n                    userId: ''\n                })\n            })\n                .then(r => r.json())\n                .then(data => {\n\n                    const doesLove = data.d;\n\n                    if (doesLove) {\n                        document.body.classList.add(\"is-following\");\n                    }\n\n                });\n\n        });\r\n\r\n        window.addEventListener(\"load\", function () {\n\n            fetch(\"/Default.aspx/GetDoesFollowOrganiser\", {\n                method: \"POST\",\n                headers: {\n                    \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\"\n                },\n                body: JSON.stringify({\n                    eventPartnerid: 7778,\n                    userId: ''\n\n                })\n            })\n                .then(r => r.json())\n                .then(data => {\n\n                    const result = data.d;\n\n                    const button = document.querySelector(\".follow-organiser\");\n\n                    if (!button)\n                        return;\n\n                    if (result.CssClass.length > 0)\n                        button.classList.add(result.CssClass);\n\n                    const span = button.querySelector(\"span\");\n\n                    if (span)\n                        span.textContent = result.Text;\n\n                });\n\n        });\n\r\n\r\n        function followorganiser(eventpartnerid) {\r\n\r\n            const button = document.querySelector(\".follow-organiser\");\r\n\r\n            if (button.classList.contains(\"following-button\")) {\r\n                // Send the like to the service\r\n                $.ajax({\r\n                    type: \"POST\",\r\n                    contentType: \"application/json; charset=utf-8\",\r\n                    url: \"/Default.aspx/RemoveFollowOrganiser\",\r\n                    data: '{ userId: \"\", partnerId: \"' + eventpartnerid + '\" }',\r\n                    contentType: \"application/json; charset=utf-8\",\r\n                    dataType: \"json\",\r\n                    success: function (r) {\r\n                        if (r.d != 'undefined' && r.d != '' && r.d != null) {\r\n                            button.classList.remove(\"following-button\");\r\n                            const span = button.querySelector(\"span\");\n                            if (span)\n                                span.textContent