/article>\r\n                    </a>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n    </div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"menu_footer_buttons\">\r\n                    <div class=\"nav-coll-links\">\r\n\r\n                        \r\n                        <a class=\"nav-coll-link\" href=\"/accountlogin\">Login</a>\r\n                        <a class=\"nav-coll-link\" href=\"/register\">Register</a>\r\n                        \r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <footer class=\"menu_footer\">\r\n\r\n                    <div id=\"footer-apps\">\r\n                        <div class=\"actions\">\r\n                            <a class=\"btn ui-gradient-green btn-app-store btn-download shadow-lg\" href=\"https://apps.apple.com/gb/app/outsavvy/id722344276\" target=\"_blank\"><span>Available on the</span> <span>App Store</span></a>\r\n                            <a class=\"btn ui-gradient-blue btn-google-play btn-download shadow-lg\" href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.outsavvyapp\" target=\"_blank\"><span>Available on </span><span>Google Play</span></a>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n\r\n                    <div class=\"menu_footer_links\">\r\n                        <a class=\"menu_footer_link\" href=\"/aboutus\">About</a>\r\n                        <a class=\"menu_footer_link\" href=\"/support\">Support</a>\r\n                        <a class=\"menu_footer_link\" href=\"/resell\">ReSell</a>\r\n                        <a class=\"menu_footer_link\" href=\"/contactus\">Contact</a>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </footer>\r\n\r\n            </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        \r\n\r\n    \r\n\r\n        <script type=\"application/ld+json\">\r\n        [{\"@context\": \"http://schema.org\",\"@type\": \"ScreeningEvent\",\"name\": \"Programmers of Tomorrow fundraiser screening #2: Closed Circuit (1978)\",\"startDate\": \"2026-10-03T19:30:00+01:00\",\"endDate\": \"2026-10-03T21:30:00+01:00\",\"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\"url\" : \"https://www.outsavvy.com/event/38388/programmers-of-tomorrow-fundraiser-screening-2-closed-circuit-1978\",\"image\" : \"https://cdn.outsavvy.com/events/d5888ac5-0c44-4490-be71-6ce708be88f7.jpg\",\"eventStatus\" : \"http://schema.org/EventScheduled\",\"description\" : \"A matinee showing of a spaghetti western becomes a whodunnit as a member of the audience is shot dead during the gunslinging showdown.The Cinema of Tomorrow (F.K.A. PEPCOT) presents the second of three screenings on the theme of ‘Movies at the Movies’. Closed Circuit (1978) was made for Italian TV, but has since become a beloved cult hit for its mix of murder mystery and a sincere and philosophical love of the ‘magic’ of cinema. Come and watch Closed Circuit as it was never intended, but where it deserves to be, up on the big screen.This event is part of Programmers of Tomorrow (PoT): A season of workshops and screenings for the future of film exhibition. Consisting of two free workshops, three fundraiser screenings and a film festival all-dayer, PoT is spreading knowledge about film programming, building community around the love of movies, and facilitating first timers to put on their first ever public screening.  Read more about it and how to get involved.This screening is a fundraiser for both PoT and its venue, the Cinema Museum. The Cinema Museum is currently raising money to buy its amazing building and cement its place as the living archive of London&#39;s cinema history. Doors will open at 6.30pm for drinks and snacks amidst the ephemera of cinemas past, showtime at 7.30pm. AccessThere is one step to get into the museum, and a lift to get into the screening hall.Accessible and all gender toilets available.Carers free, service dogs welcome.No one turned away for lack of funds. Please email us for a discounted or free ticket.If you have any other questions or requests do get in touch. cinemaoftomorrowldn@gmail.com\",\"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\",\"name\": \"The Cinema Museum\",\"address\": { \"@type\" : \"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\" : \"The Cinema Museum, 2 Dugard Way\",\"addressLocality\" : \"London\",\"addressRegion\" : \"England\",\"postalCode\" : \"SE11 4TH\" },\"geo\" : {\"@type\" : \"GeoCoordinates\", \"latitude\" : \"51.49229\", \"longitude\" : \"-0.1052203\"} },\"offers\": {\"@type\": \"AggregateOffer\", \"availability\":\"http://schema.org/InStock\", \"availabilityEnds\":\"2026-10-03T18:30:00+01:00\",\"priceCurrency\":\"GBP\",\"url\":\"https://www.outsavvy.com/event/38388/programmers-of-tomorrow-fundraiser-screening-2-closed-circuit-1978\",\"lowPrice\":12,\"highPrice\":9,\"availabilityStarts\":\"2026-07-24T12:00:12+01:00\",\"validFrom\":\"2026-07-24T12:00:12+01:00\",\"offers\":[{\"availability\":\"http://schema.org/InStock\", \"availabilityEnds\":\"2026-10-03T18:30:00+01:00\",\"name\":\"Fundraiser Ticket\",\"priceCurrency\":\"GBP\",\"url\":\"https://www.outsavvy.com/event/38388/programmers-of-tomorrow-fundraiser-screening-2-closed-circuit-1978\",\"price\":12,\"availabilityStarts\":\"2026-07-24T12:00:12+01:00\",\"validFrom\":\"2026-07-24T12:00:12+01:00\",\"@type\":\"Offer\"},{\"availability\":\"http://schema.org/InStock\", \"availabilityEnds\":\"2026-10-03T18:30:00+01:00\",\"name\":\"Standard Ticket\",\"priceCurrency\":\"GBP\",\"url\":\"https://www.outsavvy.com/event/38388/programmers-of-tomorrow-fundraiser-screening-2-closed-circuit-1978\",\"price\":9,\"availabilityStarts\":\"2026-07-24T12:00:12+01:00\",\"validFrom\":\"2026-07-24T12:00:12+01:00\",\"@type\":\"Offer\"}]},\"organizer\" : { \"@type\" : \"Organization\", \"url\" : \"https://www.outsavvy.com/organiser/cinema-of-tomorrow\", \"description\" : \"The South London-based film club F.K.A. PEPCOT (Peckham Experimental Prototype Cinema of Tomorrow) is evolving into simply… The Cinema of Tomorrow, a microcinema in the making for South East London. \", \"name\" : \"Cinema of Tomorrow\"}}]\r\n        </script>\r\n\r\n    \r\n\r\n    \r\n\r\n    <script type=\"text/javascript\">\r\n\r\n        window.addEventListener(\"load\", function () {\n\n            fetch(\"/Default.aspx/GetDoesLove\", {\n                method: \"POST\",\n                headers: {\n                    \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\"\n                },\n                body: JSON.stringify({\n                    eventId: 38388,\n                    userId: ''\n                })\n            })\n                .then(r => r.json())\n                .then(data => {\n\n                    const doesLove = data.d;\n\n                    if (doesLove) {\n                        document.body.classList.add(\"is-following\");\n                    }\n\n                });\n\n        });\r\n\r\n        window.addEventListener(\"load\", function () {\n\n            fetch(\"/Default.aspx/GetDoesFollowOrganiser\", {\n                method: \"POST\",\n                headers: {\n                    \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\"\n                },\n                body: JSON.stringify({\n                    eventPartnerid: 7030,\n                    userId: ''\n\n                })\n            })\n                .then(r => r.json())\n                .then(data => {\n\n                    const result = data.d;\n\n                    const button = document.querySelector(\".follow-organiser\");\n\n                    if (!button)\n                        return;\n\n                    if (result.CssClass.length > 0)\n                        button.classList.add(result.CssClass);\n\n                    const span = button.querySelector(\"span\");\n\n                    if (span)\n                        span.textContent = result.Text;\n\n                });\n\n        });\n\r\n\r\n        function followorganiser(eventpartnerid) {\r\n\r\n            const but