vg>\r\n                                    </div>\r\n\r\n                                </div>\r\n\r\n                            </div>\r\n                        </div>\r\n\r\n                        \r\n                    </div>\r\n\r\n                </div>\r\n            </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"hiddenLike\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"row app-notification\" style=\"display: inline-block; background-image: url(https://cdn.outsavvy.com/website/page-bg-dark.png); margin-bottom: 20px;\">\r\n                <div class=\"col-lg-1 col-md-1 col-sm-0 col-xs-0 col\"></div>\r\n                <div class=\"col-lg-10 col-md-10 col-sm-12 col-xs-12 col\">\r\n                    <div class=\"row\">\r\n                        <div class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-4 col-sm-12 col-xs-12 col\" style=\"display: flex; align-items: flex-end;\">\r\n                            <img src=\"https://cdn.outsavvy.com/website/preloader.jpg\" data-src=\"https://cdn.outsavvy.com/website/app-notification.jpg\" class=\"app-intro lazy\" />\r\n                        </div>\r\n                        <div class=\"col-lg-8 col-md-8 col-sm-12 col-xs-12 col event-description\">\r\n                            <h3 style=\"text-align: center;\">Track your loved events in your profile or on the OutSavvy App</h3>\r\n                            <ul>\r\n                                <li>Store your tickets securely on the app</li>\r\n                                <li>Browse and buy tickets on the go</li>\r\n                                <li>Get app notifications when tickets go on sale to make sure you are first in the queue</li>\r\n                            </ul>\r\n\r\n                            <div class=\"actions\" style=\"text-align: center; margin-top: 20px;\">\r\n                                <a class=\"btn ui-gradient-green btn-app-store btn-download shadow-lg\" href=\"https://apps.apple.com/gb/app/outsavvy/id722344276\" target=\"_blank\"><span>Available on the</span> <span>App Store</span></a>\r\n                                <a class=\"btn ui-gradient-blue btn-google-play btn-download shadow-lg\" href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.outsavvyapp\" target=\"_blank\"><span>Available on </span><span>Google Play</span></a>\r\n                            </div>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n                <div class=\"col-lg-1 col-md-1 col-sm-0 col-xs-0 col\"></div>\r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <div id=\"description\">\r\n            <div style=\"margin-bottom: 0\">\r\n                <section>\r\n\r\n                    <h1 class=\"event-item event-item-name\">Legendary Lezzas </h1>\r\n\r\n                    \r\n\r\n                    <div class=\"content-body\">\r\n\r\n                        <div class=\"line-red-holder\">\r\n                            <h4 class=\"line-red\" style=\"margin-top: 5px;\">Details\r\n\r\n                            </h4>\r\n                        </div>\r\n\r\n                        <div class=\"event-description\">\r\n                            <span><p><strong>Legendary Lezzas&nbsp;</strong></p><p>with Azara</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Doors at 6pm</p><p>Action at 7pm</p><p>Carriages 9.30pm</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Young Duckie host Azara meets with key players from the fledgling women’s scene in Vauxhall half a century ago.&nbsp; Featuring Siobhan Fahey, producer of the fabulous film Rebel Dykes and no relation to that bird from Bananarama.&nbsp; Rebel Dykes charts the early underground lesbian scene, from the Greenham Common Women’s Peace Camp in the early eighties to the S&amp;M action and performance wrestling at Chain Reaction, the epochal bi-weekly Tuesday nighter at the Market Tavern from 1987.&nbsp; Longtime Vauxhall dwelling promoter, door whore, singer and polymath Fisch AKA King Frankie Sinatra had a central role in the scene and tells it like it is.&nbsp; MC Driweave remembers the halcyon days of Vixens at the Vauxhall.&nbsp; And legendary promoter Suzie Kruger (TBC) talks about The Clit Club and its cultural ripples.&nbsp; They reflect on their journeys, on marginalisation, community mobilisation, rebellion and celebration.&nbsp; How did they survive, what was it like then and how are they doing now?&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Plus ‘Beeb Man Sits on Lesbian’.&nbsp; Film clips and stories from the gutsy, brilliant piece of direct action from a group of lesbians who infiltrated the BBC’s Six O’Clock News live in 1988, to protest about Section 28, with recollections from one of the activists and Sue Lawley.&nbsp; With live music from Paige Kennedy (TBC).</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Vote for your Legendary Lezza.&nbsp; Nominate an OWL, vintage dyke or veteran vagitarian and lez stand on the shoulders of sapphic superstars</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Free tea, coffee and biscuits</p><p>&nbsp;</p></span>\r\n                        </div>\r\n\r\n                        \r\n\r\n<div class=\"map-event\">\r\n\r\n    <div id=\"event_map\" class=\"event-map\">\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"map-container\">\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"col-lg-12 col-md-12 col-sm-12 col-xs-12\" style=\"padding-right: 0px; padding-left: 0px;\">\r\n                <div class=\"line-red-holder\">\r\n                    <h4 class=\"line-red\">Location\r\n    \r\n                    </h4>\r\n                </div>\r\n                <div class=\"map-padding website-map\">\r\n\r\n                    <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&z=12&query=Wheatsheaf+Community+Hall%2c+off+Wheatsheaf+Lane%2c+London%2c+SW8+2UP\" target=\"_blank\" onclick=\"return confirm('Would you like to open Google Maps?');\">\r\n\r\n                        <img src='data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 800 200\"%3E%3C/svg%3E' data-src=\"/Services/MapboxHandler.ashx?lng=-0.1252938&lat=51.48093&w=800&h=200&zoom=16\" class=\"lazy\" alt=\"Event location map\" />\r\n\r\n                    </a>\r\n\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"map-padding mobile-map\">\r\n\r\n                    <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&z=12&query=Wheatsheaf+Community+Hall%2c+off+Wheatsheaf+Lane%2c+London%2c+SW8+2UP\" target=\"_blank\" onclick=\"return confirm('Would you like to open Google Maps?');\">\r\n\r\n                        <img src='data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 800 200\"%3E%3C/svg%3E' data-src=\"/Services/MapboxHandler.ashx?lng=-0.1252938&lat=51.48093&w=500&h=250&zoom=16\" class=\"lazy\" alt=\"Event location map\" />\r\n\r\n                    </a>\r\n\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"col-lg-12 col-md-12 col-sm-12 col-xs-12\" style=\"padding-left: 0px;\">\r\n\r\n                    <p><span class=locName>Wheatsheaf Community Hall</span><br/>off Wheatsheaf Lane, London, SW8 2UP</p>\r\n\r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n                            <div class=\"line-red-holder\">\r\n                                <h4 class=\"line-red\">Tagged\r\n\r\n                                </h4>\r\n                            </div>\r\n\r\n                            <div class=\"eventtags\">\r\n                                <span class=\"eventspan\">\r\n                                    <a href=/hashtag/londonevents><svg class=\"svgfill\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"800px\" height=\"800px\" viewBox=\"0 0 48 48\">\r\n  <title>location</title>\r\n  <g id=\"Layer_2\" data-name=\"Layer 2\">\r\n    <g id=\"invisible_box\" data-name=\"invisible box\">\r\n      <rect width=\"48\" height=\"48\" fill=\"none\"/>\r\n    </g>\r\n    <g id=\"icons_Q2\" data-name=\"icons Q2\">\r\n      <path d=\"M24,14a3,3,0,1,1-3,3,2.9,2.9,0,0,1,3-3m0-4a7,7,0,1,0,7,7,7,7,0,0,0-7-7Z\"/>\r\n      <path d=\"M24,6c7.4,0,13,6,