OM DANCING ON THE STAGE IS AT YOUR OWN RISK The RVT is an LGBTQ+ venue, please respect our space. No hen/stag parties\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_GB\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:locale:alternate\" content=\"en_US\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"OutSavvy\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Bank Holiday Monday with The D.E Experience Tickets - London - OutSavvy\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://www.outsavvy.com/event/38362/bank-holiday-monday-with-the-de-experience\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:image:type\" content=\"image/jpg\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1200\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"584\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://cdn.outsavvy.com/events/daadd861-1c3c-4f93-b7f0-73bc448ca1ca.jpg\" />\r\n\r\n    <meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" />\r\n    <meta name=\"twitter:site\" content=\"@OutSavvy\" />\r\n    <meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"Bank Holiday Monday with The D.E Experience Tickets - London - OutSavvy\" />\r\n    <meta name=\"twitter:url\" content=\"https://www.outsavvy.com/event/38362/bank-holiday-monday-with-the-de-experience\" />\r\n    <meta name=\"twitter:app:name:iphone\" content=\"OutSavvy\" />\r\n    <meta name=\"twitter:app:id:iphone\" content=\"722344276\" />\r\n    <meta name=\"twitter:image\" content=\"https://cdn.outsavvy.com/events/daadd861-1c3c-4f93-b7f0-73bc448ca1ca.jpg?width=1200\" />\r\n    <meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"BANK HOLIDAY MONDAY CABARETCLINIC WITH THE D.E. EXPERIENCE MONDAY 31ST AUGUST‘Sister Edna will see you now’For August Bank Holiday Monday, following The RVT Sports Day outside, there&#39;s something special happening at The Royal Vauxhall Tavern… Clinic with the one and only D.E. ExperienceCome and feel the love at the perfect recovery from a hectic Bank Holi