 Thursday is a runway and every voice deserves the mic\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_GB\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:locale:alternate\" content=\"en_US\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"OutSavvy\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Drag Race UK Season 8 - Viewing Party Tickets - London - OutSavvy\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://www.outsavvy.com/event/38727/drag-race-uk-season-8-viewing-party\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:image:type\" content=\"image/jpg\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1200\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"584\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://cdn.outsavvy.com/events/b67a56f2-4371-47c1-9eb9-c3ada9927e48.png\" />\r\n\r\n    <meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" />\r\n    <meta name=\"twitter:site\" content=\"@OutSavvy\" />\r\n    <meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"Drag Race UK Season 8 - Viewing Party Tickets - London - OutSavvy\" />\r\n    <meta name=\"twitter:url\" content=\"https://www.outsavvy.com/event/38727/drag-race-uk-season-8-viewing-party\" />\r\n    <meta name=\"twitter:app:name:iphone\" content=\"OutSavvy\" />\r\n    <meta name=\"twitter:app:id:iphone\" content=\"722344276\" />\r\n    <meta name=\"twitter:image\" content=\"https://cdn.outsavvy.com/events/b67a56f2-4371-47c1-9eb9-c3ada9927e48.png?width=1200\" />\r\n    <meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"&#127881; Drag Race UK Season 8 Viewing Party at ZODIAC Bar &#127881;Every Thursday | Drag Bingo at 8PM | Screening at 9PMThursdays at ZODIAC are serving charisma, camp, and chaos — hosted by the one-legged legend herself, Eileen Eiffell.  Come through for our weekly Drag Race UK Season 8 viewing party, where the queens are fierce and the crowd is even fiercer.&#128132; Your Thursday night lineup:•     &#127921; Drag Bingo at 8PM — cheeky prizes,