467.9l37.39-163.83Z\" />\r\n                            </svg>\r\n\r\n                            <span>Accessibility - Accessible Toilets, Complimentary Ticket for Assistant, Quiet Space, Relaxed Performance, Service Animals Area, Step Free Access, Wheelchair Accessible</span>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                        \r\n\r\n                        <div id=\"shareevent2\" style=\"font-size: 14px; width: 100%; margin-top: 5px; text-align: center;\" class=\"sharevent jssocials\">\r\n                            <div class=\"jssocials-shares\">\r\n\r\n                                <div class=\"jssocials-share\">\r\n\r\n                                    <div onclick=\"loveevent(38151)\" class='like-button' title=\"Unlove This Event\" style=\"cursor: pointer;\">\r\n                                        <div class='like-icon'>\r\n                                            <div class='heart-animation-1'></div>\r\n                                            <div class='heart-animation-2'></div>\r\n                                        </div>\r\n                                    </div>\r\n\r\n                                </div>\r\n\r\n                                <div class=\"jssocials-share\">\r\n\r\n                                    <div onclick=\"showShareModal()\" class=\"jssocials-share jssocials-share-share\" style=\"cursor: pointer; margin: 0;\" data-original-title=\"Share This Event\">\r\n\r\n                                        <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"28px\" height=\"28px\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\">\r\n                                            <path opacity=\"1\" d=\"M21 6C21 7.65685 19.6569 9 18 9C16.3431 9 15 7.65685 15 6C15 4.34315 16.3431 3 18 3C19.6569 3 21 4.34315 21 6Z\" fill=\"#FFF\"></path>\r\n                                            <path opacity=\"1\" d=\"M21 18C21 19.6569 19.6569 21 18 21C16.3431 21 15 19.6569 15 18C15 16.3431 16.3431 15 18 15C19.6569 15 21 16.3431 21 18Z\" fill=\"#FFF\"></path>\r\n                                            <path opacity=\"1\" d=\"M9 12C9 13.6569 7.65685 15 6 15C4.34315 15 3 13.6569 3 12C3 10.3431 4.34315 9 6 9C7.65685 9 9 10.3431 9 12Z\" fill=\"#FFF\"></path>\r\n                                            <path d=\"M21 6C21 7.65685 19.6569 9 18 9C16.3431 9 15 7.65685 15 6C15 4.34315 16.3431 3 18 3C19.6569 3 21 4.34315 21 6Z\" stroke=\"#323232\" stroke-width=\"2\"></path>\r\n                                            <path d=\"M21 18C21 19.6569 19.6569 21 18 21C16.3431 21 15 19.6569 15 18C15 16.3431 16.3431 15 18 15C19.6569 15 21 16.3431 21 18Z\" stroke=\"#323232\" stroke-width=\"2\"></path>\r\n                                            <path d=\"M9 12C9 13.6569 7.65685 15 6 15C4.34315 15 3 13.6569 3 12C3 10.3431 4.34315 9 6 9C7.65685 9 9 10.3431 9 12Z\" stroke=\"#323232\" stroke-width=\"2\"></path>\r\n                                            <path d=\"M8.7207 10.6397L15.0001 7.5\" stroke=\"#323232\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path>\r\n                                            <path d=\"M8.70605 13.353L15 16.5\" stroke=\"#323232\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path>\r\n                                        </svg>\r\n                                    </div>\r\n\r\n                                </div>\r\n\r\n                            </div>\r\n                        </div>\r\n\r\n                        \r\n                    </div>\r\n\r\n                </div>\r\n            </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"hiddenLike\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"row app-notification\" style=\"display: inline-block; background-image: url(https://cdn.outsavvy.com/website/page-bg-dark.png); margin-bottom: 20px;\">\r\n                <div class=\"col-lg-1 col-md-1 col-sm-0 col-xs-0 col\"></div>\r\n                <div class=\"col-lg-10 col-md-10 col-sm-12 col-xs-12 col\">\r\n                    <div class=\"row\">\r\n                        <div class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-4 col-sm-12 col-xs-12 col\" style=\"display: flex; align-items: flex-end;\">\r\n                            <img src=\"https://cdn.outsavvy.com/website/preloader.jpg\" data-src=\"https://cdn.outsavvy.com/website/app-notification.jpg\" class=\"app-intro lazy\" />\r\n                        </div>\r\n                        <div class=\"col-lg-8 col-md-8 col-sm-12 col-xs-12 col event-description\">\r\n                            <h3 style=\"text-align: center;\">Track your loved events in your profile or on the OutSavvy App</h3>\r\n                            <ul>\r\n                                <li>Store your tickets securely on the app</li>\r\n                                <li>Browse and buy tickets on the go</li>\r\n                                <li>Get app notifications when tickets go on sale to make sure you are first in the queue</li>\r\n                            </ul>\r\n\r\n                            <div class=\"actions\" style=\"text-align: center; margin-top: 20px;\">\r\n                                <a class=\"btn ui-gradient-green btn-app-store btn-download shadow-lg\" href=\"https://apps.apple.com/gb/app/outsavvy/id722344276\" target=\"_blank\"><span>Available on the</span> <span>App Store</span></a>\r\n                                <a class=\"btn ui-gradient-blue btn-google-play btn-download shadow-lg\" href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.outsavvyapp\" target=\"_blank\"><span>Available on </span><span>Google Play</span></a>\r\n                            </div>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n                <div class=\"col-lg-1 col-md-1 col-sm-0 col-xs-0 col\"></div>\r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <div id=\"description\">\r\n            <div style=\"margin-bottom: 0\">\r\n                <section>\r\n\r\n                    <h1 class=\"event-item event-item-name\">Alliance4Choice presents... Wholly Trinity: Abortion, Art and Activism in Northern Ireland</h1>\r\n\r\n                    \r\n\r\n                    <div class=\"content-body\">\r\n\r\n                        <div class=\"line-red-holder\">\r\n                            <h4 class=\"line-red\" style=\"margin-top: 5px;\">Details\r\n\r\n                            </h4>\r\n                        </div>\r\n\r\n                        <div class=\"event-description\">\r\n                            <span><h3>Join us for a screening of Wholly Trinity: Abortion, Art and Activism in Northern Ireland followed by a discussion and Q&amp;A</h3><h3>🎥✊🏻🎨📢</h3><p>\"…art can assist people to learn not only about the objective forces at work in the society in which they live, but also about the intensely social character of their interior lives. Ultimately, it can propel people toward social emancipation.\" (Angela Davis). <i>Wholly Trinity</i> was produced collaboratively by The Open University, Alliance for Choice and The Array Collective explores the role that artists and creatives played in campaigning for abortion rights in Ireland.</p><p>As pro-life movements try to rally support in London this week, we invite you to join this screening and the following conversation exploring the power of art as a vehicle for reform, resistance and liberation — in Northern Ireland and around the world. It is more important than ever to stay alert to the ongoing struggle for reproductive justice as rights are silently stripped away and public discourse slides to the right.</p><p>How have abortion rights been won? And by whom? What does mass mobilisation look like? How do artists and creatives not only document, but actively participate in liberatory struggles?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><u>Speakers</u></p><p>Danielle Roberts is co-convenor&nbsp;of Alliance for Choice, a Belfast based feminist campaigning group&nbsp;advocating for&nbsp;abortion access, comprehensive sex education, and an end to reproductive stigma while providing practical support.&nbsp;She has extensive experience as a policy worker advocating for LGBTQIA+ and women's rights and was heavily involved in the Repeal the 8<sup>th</sup>&nbsp;and Decriminalisation campaigns.</p><p>Cassie Fox is the founder of LOUD WOMEN, a not-for-profit organisation and international network championing women and non-binary artists in music. She is also a musician with feminist punk band I, Doris, presenter of LOUD WOMEN Radio on Resonance FM, a university lecturer and an author.</p><p>Sandy AbdelRahman is a cultural producer, organisational practitioner, Artivist, and speaker driving social change through creativity, community, and decolonial practice. With over a decade of experience across the arts, social justice and charity sectors, her work sits at the intersection of diaspora, art, gender justice, and collective liberation.</p><p>Chair: Katja Holtz (she/her) is a writer and organiser invested in crafting bright, green, queer futures. With a background in anthropology and migration studies, her work is informed by anti-colonial and restorative philosophies&nbsp;— invested in excavating community out of the quagmire of 21st-century atomisation. At the moment, she is the Operations Manager at the world's first and only Vagina Museum; find her restocking the toilet paper in between co-editing the Museum's zine and managing the events programme.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><u>Schedule</u></p><p>Doors &amp; buffer: 19:15 - 19:30</p><p>Screening: 19:30 - 20:00</p><p>Comfort break: 20:00 - 20:15</p><p>Discussion: 20:15 - 21:00</p><p>Q&amp;A: 21:00 - 21:15</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h3>About the project</h3><p>Art has always been a powerful vehicle for social justice and the struggle for abortion rights throughout the island of Ireland was no exception. This beautiful short film depicts the commitment, creativity, colour and emotion that artists brought to the Irish abortion campaigns. Through interviews with the artists themselves, it describes how artists used creativity and performance to inspire people to action, ignite powerful conversations and build communities of solidarity. It explores how art can change opinions, transcend barriers, shape narratives and make history, her story and their story.</p></span>\r\n                        </div>\r\n\r\n                        \r\n\r\n<div class=\"map-event\">\r\n\r\n    <div id=\"event_map\" class=\"event-map\">\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"map-container\">\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"col-lg-12 col-md-12 col-sm-12 col-xs-12\" style=\"padding-right: 0px; padding-left: 0px;\">\r\n                <div class=\"line-red-holder\">\r\n                    <h4 class=\"line-red\">Location\r\n    \r\n                    </h4>\r\n                </div>\r\n                <div class=\"map-padding website-map\">\r\n\r\n                    <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&z=12&query=Vagina+Museum%2c+275+Poyser+Street%2c+London%2c+E2+9HD\" target=\"_blank\" onclick=\"return confirm('Would you like to open Google Maps?');\">\r\n\r\n                        <img src='data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 800 200\"%3E%3C/svg%3E' data-src=\"/Services/MapboxHandler.ashx?lng=-0.0569347&lat=51.53035&w=800&h=200&zoom=16\" class=\"lazy\" alt=\"Event location map\" />\r\n\r\n                    </a>\r\n\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"map-padding mobile-map\">\r\n\r\n                    <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&z=12&query=Vagina+Museum%2c+275+Poyser+Street%2c+London%2c+E2+9HD\" target=\"_blank\" onclick=\"return confirm('Would you like to open Google Maps?');\">\r\n\r\n                        <img src='data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 800 200\"%3E%3C/svg%3E' data-src=\"/Services/MapboxHandler.ashx?lng=-0.0569347&lat=51.53035&w=500&h=250&zoom=16\" class=\"lazy\" alt=\"Ev