               </a>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                        \r\n                    </div>\r\n\r\n                    \r\n\r\n<div class=\"nav-advert\">\r\n    <div id=\"eventscontent\" class=\"module-box row\">\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"newspanel\" id=\"tab-all\" style=\"display: block;\">\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"row row-16\">\r\n                <div class=\"col-lg-12 col-md-12 col-sm-12 col-xs-12\">\r\n                    <a href=\"/event/38362/bank-holiday-monday-with-the-de-experience\" aria-label=\"Bank Holiday Monday with The D.E Experience\">\r\n                        <article class=\"entry\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">\r\n                            <div class=\"thumb-bg-holder entry__bg-img-holder\">\r\n                                \r\n                                <div class=\"feature-price\">Tickets Off Sale</div>\r\n                                \r\n                                <img class=\"lazy\" src='https://cdn.outsavvy.com/website/preloader.jpg' data-src=\"https://cdn.outsavvy.com/bannerimage/5a9f93bd-91f8-46b9-a54a-563b5dd5009b.jpg\" alt=\"Bank Holiday Monday with The D.E Experience\" />\r\n                                <div class=\"bottom-gradient\"></div>\r\n                            </div>\r\n                            <div class=\"thumb-text-holder\">\r\n                                <h2 class=\"thumb-entry-title\">\r\n                                    Bank Holiday Monday with The D.E Experience\r\n                                </h2>\r\n                                \r\n                                <div class=\"banner-entry-location\">Royal Vauxhall Tavern - Monday 31st August 2026</div>\r\n                                \r\n                            </div>\r\n                        </article>\r\n                    </a>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n    </div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"menu_footer_buttons\">\r\n                    <div class=\"nav-coll-links\">\r\n\r\n                        \r\n                        <a class=\"nav-coll-link\" href=\"/accountlogin\">Login</a>\r\n                        <a class=\"nav-coll-link\" href=\"/register\">Register</a>\r\n                        \r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <footer class=\"menu_footer\">\r\n\r\n                    <div id=\"footer-apps\">\r\n                        <div class=\"actions\">\r\n                            <a class=\"btn ui-gradient-green btn-app-store btn-download shadow-lg\" href=\"https://apps.apple.com/gb/app/outsavvy/id722344276\" target=\"_blank\"><span>Available on the</span> <span>App Store</span></a>\r\n                            <a class=\"btn ui-gradient-blue btn-google-play btn-download shadow-lg\" href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.outsavvyapp\" target=\"_blank\"><span>Available on </span><span>Google Play</span></a>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n\r\n                    <div class=\"menu_footer_links\">\r\n                        <a class=\"menu_footer_link\" href=\"/aboutus\">About</a>\r\n                        <a class=\"menu_footer_link\" href=\"/support\">Support</a>\r\n                        <a class=\"menu_footer_link\" href=\"/resell\">ReSell</a>\r\n                        <a class=\"menu_footer_link\" href=\"/contactus\">Contact</a>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </footer>\r\n\r\n            </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        \r\n\r\n    \r\n\r\n        <script type=\"application/ld+json\">\r\n        [{\"@context\": \"http://schema.org\",\"@type\": \"ScreeningEvent\",\"name\": \"B.O.S.S. Presents : Screen and Sound\",\"startDate\": \"2026-09-20T18:00:00+01:00\",\"endDate\": \"2026-09-20T21:00:00+01:00\",\"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\"url\" : \"https://www.outsavvy.com/event/39106/boss-presents-screen-and-sound\",\"image\" : \"https://cdn.outsavvy.com/events/27aa9067-61e0-47f2-ae09-3a2e58e4f015.jpeg\",\"eventStatus\" : \"http://schema.org/EventScheduled\",\"description\" : \"Curated by Kiera Coward Deyell, Angelica Udueni and Adedamola Boluwatife, Black Obsidian Sound System present their picks from Fringe, accompanied by a deep listening session in response.  Black Obsidian Sound System (B.O.S.S.) was established in the summer of 2018 with the intention of bringing together a community of queer, trans and non-binary black and people of colour involved in art, sound and radical activism. Following in the legacies of sound system culture they wanted to learn, build and sustain a resource for our collective struggles. The black-led system, based in London, is available to use or rent by community groups and others with the purpose of amplifying and connecting them. B.O.S.S&#39;s work includes renting the system to the community at subsidised rates or for free, technical workshops, live performance events, club nights, art installations and various creative commissions including a short film ‘Collective Hum’ (2019) for LUX &amp;amp; the ICO and &#39;The Only Good System is a Sound System&#39; for Liverpool Biennial (2020). In 2021 B.O.S.S was shortlisted for the Turner Prize and presented an exhibition at Herbert Museum and Gallery Coventry. The Piehouse is a not-for-profit, worker-run, wheelchair accessible music and arts venue in a railway arch in Deptford. Their work focuses on platforming groups that typically find themselves left out of mainstream cultural programming, with a focus on queer, disabled, working class and POC artists. *Everyone is welcome at our events.  If you can&#39;t afford the entry to the event, please drop us an email to arts@fringefilmfest.com and we&#39;ll be able to help you. \",\"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\",\"name\": \"Piehouse Co-Op\",\"address\": { \"@type\" : \"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\" : \"Piehouse Co-Op, 213-214 Edward Place\",\"addressLocality\" : \"London\",\"addressRegion\" : \"England\",\"postalCode\" : \"SE8 5HD\" },\"geo\" : {\"@type\" : \"GeoCoordinates\", \"latitude\" : \"51.48091\", \"longitude\" : \"-0.0317343\"} },\"offers\": {\"@type\": \"AggregateOffer\", \"availability\":\"http://schema.org/InStock\", \"availabilityEnds\":\"2026-09-20T17:00:00+01:00\",\"priceCurrency\":\"GBP\",\"url\":\"https://www.outsavvy.com/event/39106/boss-presents-screen-and-sound\",\"lowPrice\":15,\"highPrice\":10,\"availabilityStarts\":\"2026-08-27T15:46:52+01:00\",\"validFrom\":\"2026-08-27T15:46:52+01:00\",\"offers\":[{\"availability\":\"http://schema.org/InStock\", \"availabilityEnds\":\"2026-09-20T17:00:00+01:00\",\"name\":\"Community\",\"priceCurrency\":\"GBP\",\"url\":\"https://www.outsavvy.com/event/39106/boss-presents-screen-and-sound\",\"price\":10,\"availabilityStarts\":\"2026-08-27T15:46:52+01:00\",\"validFrom\":\"2026-08-27T15:46:52+01:00\",\"@type\":\"Offer\"},{\"availability\":\"http://schema.org/InStock\", \"availabilityEnds\":\"2026-09-20T17:00:00+01:00\",\"name\":\"General Admission\",\"priceCurrency\":\"GBP\",\"url\":\"https://www.outsavvy.com/event/39106/boss-presents-screen-and-sound\",\"price\":13,\"availabilityStarts\":\"2026-08-27T15:46:52+01:00\",\"validFrom\":\"2026-08-27T15:46:52+01:00\",\"@type\":\"Offer\"},{\"availability\":\"http://schema.org/InStock\", \"availabilityEnds\":\"2026-09-20T17:00:00+01:00\",\"name\":\"Solidarity\",\"priceCurrency\":\"GBP\",\"url\":\"https://www.outsavvy.com/event/39106/boss-presents-screen-and-sound\",\"price\":15,\"availabilityStarts\":\"2026-08-27T15:46:52+01:00\",\"validFrom\":\"2026-08-27T15:46:52+01:00\",\"@type\":\"Offer\"}]},\"organizer\" : { \"@type\" : \"Organization\", \"url\" : \"https://www.outsavvy.com/organiser/fringe\", \"description\" : \"Fringe.  is a film and arts festival rooted in London&#39;s queer creative scene and welcoming everyone. We&#39;re not-for-profit and run by a team of passionate volunteers. From feature films to experimental art, workshops to talks and wild parties to tickle every one of the senses. With our signature blend of eye opening movies, DIY and experimental work, the thoughtful, the provocative and the strange.Fringe.  Fest was launched in 2011, by a group of queer creatives as a community response to arts cuts carnage. Our mission is to offer a dynamic, representative and unmistakably fresh alternative to other film and arts festivals.\", \"name\" : \"Fringe! Queer Film &amp; Arts Fest\"}}]\r\n        </script>\r\n\r\n    \r\n\r\n    \r\n\r\n    <script type=\"text/javascript\">\r\n\r\n        window.addEventListener(\"load\", function () {\n\n            fetch(\"/Default.aspx/GetDoesLove\", {\n                method: \"POST\",\n                headers: {\n                    \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\"\n                },\n                body: JSON.stringify({\n                    eventId: 39106,\n                    userId: ''\n                })\n            })\n                .then(r => r.json())\n                .then(data => {\n\n                    const doesLove = data.d;\n\n                    if (doesLove) {\n                        document.body.classList.add(\"is-following\");\n                    }\n\n                });\n\n        });\r\n\r\n        window.addEventListener(\"load\", function () {\n\n            fetch(\"/Default.aspx/GetDoesFollowOrganiser\", {\n                method: \"POST\",\n                headers: {\n                    \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\"\n                },\n                body: JSON.stringify({\n                    eventPartnerid: 27,\n                    userId: ''\n\n                })\n            })\n                .then(r => r.json())\n                .then(data => {\n\n                    const result = data.d;\n\n                    const button = document.querySelector(\".follow-organiser\");\n\n                    if (!button)\n                        return;\n\n                    if (result.CssClass.length > 0)\n                        button.classList.add(result.CssClass);\n\n                    const span = button.querySelector(\"span\");\n\n                    if (span)\n                        span.textContent = result.Text;\n\n                });\n\n        });\n\r\n\r\n        function followorganiser(eventpartnerid) {\r\n\r\n            const button = document.querySelector(\".follow-organiser\");\r\n\r\n            if (button.classList.contains(\"following-button\")) {\r\n                // Send the like to the service\r\n                $.ajax({\r\n                    type: \"POST\",\r\n                    contentType: \"application/json; charset=utf-8\",\r\n                    url: \"/Default.aspx/RemoveFollowOrganiser\",\r\n                    data: '{ userId: \"\", partnerId: \"' + eventpartnerid + '\" }',\r\n                    contentType: \"application/json; charset=utf-8\",\r\n                    dataType: \"json\",\r\n                    success: function (r) {\r\n                        if (r.d != 'undefined' && r.d != '' && r.d != null) {\r\n                            button.classList.remove(\"following-button\");\r\n                            const span = button.querySelector(\"span\");\n                            if (span)\n                                span.textContent = \"Follow\";\r\n                        }\r\n                    },\r\n                    failure: function (r) {\r\n                    },\r\n                    error: function (r) {\r\n                    }\r\n                });\r\n            } else {\r\n                // Send the like to the service\r\n                $.ajax({\r\n                    type: \"POST\",\r\n                    contentType: \"application/json; charset=utf-8\",\r\n                    url: \"/Default.aspx/AddFollowOrganiser\",\r\n                    data: '{ userId: \"\", partnerId: \"' + eventpartnerid + '\" }',\r\