            "text": "\r\n\r\n<!DOCTYPE html>\r\n<!--[if lt IE 7]> \t\t\t\t<html xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" xml:lang=\"en\" lang=\"en\" class=\"ie ie6 lte9 lte8 lte7 \">\t<![endif]-->\r\n<!--[if IE 7]>\t\t\t\t\t<html xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" xml:lang=\"en\" lang=\"en\" class=\"ie ie7 lte9 lte8 lte7 \">\t<![endif]-->\r\n<!--[if IE 8]>\t\t\t\t\t<html xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" xml:lang=\"en\" lang=\"en\" class=\"ie ie8 lte9 lte8 \">\t\t<![endif]-->\r\n<!--[if IE 9]>\t\t\t\t\t<html xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" xml:lang=\"en\" lang=\"en\" class=\"ie ie9 lte9 \">\t\t\t\t<![endif]-->\r\n<!--[if (gt IE 9)|!(IE)]><!-->\r\n<html xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" xml:lang=\"en\" lang=\"en\">\r\n<!--<![endif]-->\r\n<head id=\"Head1\"><title>\r\n\tLost in the Foxglove Presents: In defense of messiness. Visualizer Screening Tickets | 22 Sep @ Rhizomatic!, London | £7 to £22 | OutSavvy\r\n</title>\r\n\r\n    <script type=\"text/javascript\">\r\n        window.dataLayer = window.dataLayer || [];\r\n\r\n        function gtag() { dataLayer.push(arguments); }\r\n\r\n        if (window.location.hash ? window.location.hash == '#cs-scan' : false) {\r\n            gtag(\"consent\", \"default\", { ad_storage: \"granted\", ad_user_data: \"granted\", ad_personalization: \"granted\", analytics_storage: \"granted\", functionality_storage: \"granted\", personalization_storage: \"granted\", security_storage: \"granted\", wait_for_update: 500 });\r\n        }\r\n        else {\r\n            gtag(\"consent\", \"default\", {\r\n                ad_storage: \"denied\",\r\n                ad_user_data: \"denied\",\r\n                ad_personalization: \"denied\",\r\n                analytics_storage: \"denied\",\r\n                functionality_storage: \"granted\",\r\n                personalization_storage: \"granted\",\r\n                security_storage: \"granted\",\r\n                wait_for_update: 500,\r\n            });\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        gtag(\"set\", \"ads_data_redaction\", true);\r\n\r\n        gtag(\"set\", \"developer_id.dZTlmZj\", true);\r\n    </script>\r\n\r\n    <script async src=\"https://consent.studio/outsavvy.com/banner.js\"></script>\r\n\r\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"/combres.axd/siteCss/7fe0f610674626944167a99dcfa57a351cfe742a930afe976c016bb3f608223c5956cdd8ab3167f15d9b50a337b27eba0ccb8113b99bd5e19f1cee33041b1821/\"/><script type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"/combres.axd/siteJs/4ea27d3d3dfdcea6aa2256650964498a5d720acb896b38d1bcbc2a81e57470911dd600418c7f575901cd7b3741c1b3a433126ce5ab0a56f134539cecb5333ade/\"></script>\r\n\r\n    <meta name=\"Priority\" content=\"1.0\" />\r\n    <meta name=\"ChangeFrequency\" content=\"daily\" />\r\n\r\n    <meta http-equiv=\"last-modified\" name=\"LastModified\" content=\"2026-08-27\" />\r\n\r\n    \r\n    <meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow\" />\r\n    \r\n\r\n    <meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Lost in the Foxglove presents a visualiser screening of second self-published poetry collection: In defense of messiness. Serving as an expansion to IDOM&#39;s literary universe, Bulla filmed and directed her first ever moving picture rendition of the book. The evening will begin with the screening, followed by a 1:1 Q&amp;amp;A with Bulla, chaired by esteemed director and photographer, Kiera Simpson (kierasimpson.com). Afterwards, three London-based creatives positioned across various industries will join the panel and expand the conversation.That&#39;s not all.  There will also be a microbiome kissing booth facilitated by inimitable artist, Emma Walker. Designer and artist, Rose will be selling one of one garments inspired by the poetry collection. And Tooth Gems Cutie will have a variety of tooth gems on offer. Lastly.  Guests will be able to purchase special, second edition signed copies of In defense of messiness. which will include select handwritten (&amp;amp; scanned) poems and a little more insight into the inspiration behind the collection. These can be purchased in advance with your ticket, or in person. \" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_GB\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:locale:alternate\" content=\"en_US\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"OutSavvy\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Lost in the Foxglove Presents: In defense of messiness. Visualizer Screening Tickets - London - OutSavvy\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://www.outsavvy.com/event/38969/lost-in-the-foxglove-presents-in-defense-of-messiness-visualizer-screening\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:image:type\" content=\"image/jpg\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1200\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"584\" />\r\n    <meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://cdn.outsavvy.com/events/6aea47d4-8a9f-4e18-99e4-9a078ded2e3d.jpg\" />\r\n\r\n    <meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" />\r\n    <meta name=\"twitter:site\" content=\"@OutSavvy\" />\r\n    <meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"Lost in the Foxglove Presents: In defense of messiness. Visualizer Screening Tickets - London - OutSavvy\" />\r\n    <meta name=\"twitter:url\" content=\"https://www.outsavvy.com/event/38969/lost-in-the-foxglove-presents-in-defense-of-messiness-visualizer-screening\" />\r\n    <meta name=\"twitter:app:name:iphone\" content=\"OutSavvy\" />\r\n    <meta name=\"twitter:app:id:iphone\" content=\"722344276\" />\r\n    <meta name=\"twitter:image\" content=\"https://cdn.outsavvy.com/events/6aea47d4-8a9f-4e18-99e4-9a078ded2e3d.jpg?width=1200\" />\r\n    <meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"Lost in the Foxglove presents a visualiser screening of second self-published poetry collection: In defense of messiness. Serving as an expansion to IDOM&#39;s literary universe, Bulla filmed and directed her first ever moving picture rendition of the book. The evening will begin with the screening, followed by a 1:1 Q&amp;amp;A with Bulla, chaired by esteemed director and photographer, Kiera Simpson (kierasimpson.com). Afterwards, three London-based creatives positioned across various industries will join the panel and expand the conversation.That&#39;s not all.  There will also be a microbiome kissing booth facilitated by inimitable artist, Emma Walker. Designer and artist, Rose will be selling one of one garments inspired by the poetry collection. And Tooth Gems Cutie will have a variety of tooth gems on offer. Lastly.  Guests will be able to purchase special, second edition signed copies of In defense of messiness. which will include select handwritten (&amp;amp; scanned) poems and a little more insight into the inspiration behind the collection. These can be purchased in advance with your ticket, or in person. \" />\r\n\r\n    <link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://www.outsavvy.com/event/38969/lost-in-the-foxglove-presents-in-defense-of-messiness-visualizer-screening\" />\r\n\r\n    <meta name=\"description\" content=\"OutSavvy | Lost in the Foxglove Presents: In defense of messiness. Visualizer Screening | Tuesday 22nd September 2026 @ Rhizomatic! | £7 to £22 | Find event and ticket information for Lauren Bulla Art\" />\r\n\r\n    <script type=\"text/javascript\">\r\n        $(document).ready(function () {\r\n\r\n            var cookieEnabled = navigator.cookieEnabled;\r\n\r\n            // When cookieEnabled flag is present and false then cookies are disabled.\r\n            if (cookieEnabled === false) {\r\n                window.location.replace(\"http://www.outsavvy.com\");\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            // try to set a test cookie if we can't see any cookies and we're using \r\n            // either a browser that doesn't support navigator.cookieEnabled\r\n            // or IE (which always returns true for navigator.cookieEnabled)\r\n            if (!document.cookie && (cookieEnabled === null || /*@cc_on!@*/false)) {\r\n                document.cookie = \"testcookie=1\";\r\n\r\n                if (!document.cookie) {\r\n                    window.location.replace(\"http://www.outsavvy.com\");\r\n                } else {\r\n                    document.cookie = \"testcookie=; expires=\" + new Date(0).toUTCString();\r\n                }\r\n            }\r\n\r\n        });\r\n\r\n        function toggleShowPassword(clientId) {\r\n            let x = document.getElementById(clientId);\r\n            if (x.type === \"password\") {\r\n                x.type = \"text\";\r\n            } else {\r\n                x.type = \"password\";\r\n            }\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        function showShareModal() {\r\n            $('#shareModal').reveal({\r\n                animation: 'fadeAndPop',                   //fade, fadeAndPop, none\r\n                animationspseeed: 300,                       //how fast animtions are\r\n                closeonbackgroundclick: true,              //if you click background will modal close?\r\n                dismissmodalclass: 'close-reveal-modal'    //the class of a button or element that will close an open modal\r\n            });\r\n        }\r\n\r\n    </script>\r\n\r\n<link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" sizes=\"57x57\" href=\"https://cdn.outsavvy.com/website/favicon/apple-icon-57x57.png\" /><link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" sizes=\"60x60\" href=\"https://cdn.outsavvy.com/website/favicon/apple-icon-60x60.png\" /><link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" sizes=\"72x72\" href=\"https://cdn.outsavvy.com/website/favicon/apple-icon-72x72.png\" /><link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" sizes=\"76x76\" href=\"https://cdn.outsavvy.com/website/favicon/apple-icon-76x76.png\" /><link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" sizes=\"114x114\" href=\"https://cdn.outsavvy.com/website/favicon/apple-icon-114x114.png\" /><link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" sizes=\"120x120\" href=\"https://cdn.outsavvy.com/website/favicon/apple-icon-120x120.png\" /><link rel=\"apple-touch-ico