ets go on sale to make sure you are first in the queue</li>\r\n                            </ul>\r\n\r\n                            <div class=\"actions\" style=\"text-align: center; margin-top: 20px;\">\r\n                                <a class=\"btn ui-gradient-green btn-app-store btn-download shadow-lg\" href=\"https://apps.apple.com/gb/app/outsavvy/id722344276\" target=\"_blank\"><span>Available on the</span> <span>App Store</span></a>\r\n                                <a class=\"btn ui-gradient-blue btn-google-play btn-download shadow-lg\" href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.outsavvyapp\" target=\"_blank\"><span>Available on </span><span>Google Play</span></a>\r\n                            </div>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n                <div class=\"col-lg-1 col-md-1 col-sm-0 col-xs-0 col\"></div>\r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <div id=\"description\">\r\n            <div style=\"margin-bottom: 0\">\r\n                <section>\r\n\r\n                    <h1 class=\"event-item event-item-name\">It's October 3rd: A Mean Girls Party!</h1>\r\n\r\n                    \r\n\r\n                    <div class=\"content-body\">\r\n\r\n                        <div class=\"line-red-holder\">\r\n                            <h4 class=\"line-red\" style=\"margin-top: 5px;\">Details\r\n\r\n                            </h4>\r\n                        </div>\r\n\r\n                        <div class=\"event-description\">\r\n                            <span><h2>Welcome to Northshore Academy… Well, actually it's in the two brewers…</h2><p>&nbsp;</p><p>It's October 3rd, and that can only mean one thing: MEAN GIRLS!&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>We're hosting an interactive, “quote-a-long” screening of the iconic 2004 classic, with drag hosts, a Mean Girls Quiz and plenty of 00's nostalgia!</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Expect silliness galore as we poke fun, shout-out iconic quotes and get involved in London's campest viewing party!</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Doors @ 6.30</p><p>Party starts @ 7pm</p><p>Hosted by Woe Addams and Pixie Polite!</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>So what are you waiting for? Limited tickets available so don't miss out, it's gonna be so FETCH! &lt;3</p><p>&nbsp;</p></span>\r\n                        </div>\r\n\r\n                        \r\n\r\n<div class=\"map-event\">\r\n\r\n    <div id=\"event_map\" class=\"event-map\">\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"map-container\">\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"col-lg-12 col-md-12 col-sm-12 col-xs-12\" style=\"padding-right: 0px; padding-left: 0px;\">\r\n                <div class=\"line-red-holder\">\r\n                    <h4 class=\"line-red\">Location\r\n    \r\n                    </h4>\r\n                </div>\r\n                <div class=\"map-padding website-map\">\r\n\r\n                    <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&z=12&query=Two+Brewers%2c+114+Clapham+High+Street%2c+London%2c+SW4+7UJ\" target=\"_blank\" onclick=\"return confirm('Would you like to open Google Maps?');\">\r\n\r\n                        <img src='data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 800 200\"%3E%3C/svg%3E' data-src=\"/Services/MapboxHandler.ashx?lng=-0.1348425&lat=51.4631&w=800&h=200&zoom=16\" class=\"lazy\" alt=\"Event location map\" />\r\n\r\n                    </a>\r\n\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"map-padding mobile-map\">\r\n\r\n                    <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&z=12&query=Two+Brewers%2c+114+Clapham+High+Street%2c+London%2c+SW4+7UJ\" target=\"_blank\" onclick=\"return confirm('Would you like to open Google Maps?');\">\r\n\r\n                        <img src='data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 800 200\"%3E%3C/svg%3E' data-src=\"/Services/MapboxHandler.ashx?lng=-0.1348425&lat=51.4631&w=500&h=250&zoom=16\" class=\"lazy\" alt=\"Event location