itinglist\"></span>\n                                    <span class=\"availability-label\">Waiting List</span>\n                                </li>\n                            </ul>\n\n                            <div class=\"modal_actions\">\n                                <div>\n                                    <button class=\"datepicker-close\" type=\"button\" onclick=\"closeModal()\">Cancel</button>\n                                </div>\n                                <div>\n                                    <button class=\"confirm-button inactive\" type=\"button\">Confirm</button>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n\n                            <div class=\"close-reveal-modal\">&#215;</div>\n\n                        </div>\n\n                    </div>\n\n\n                        \r\n</div><div id=\"FullWidth_SelectTickets_Update1\">\r\n\t\n\n                        <input type=\"submit\" name=\"ctl00$FullWidth$SelectTickets$ButtonDateRefresh\" value=\"\" id=\"FullWidth_SelectTickets_ButtonDateRefresh\" style=\"display:none;\" />\n\n                <input name=\"ctl00$FullWidth$SelectTickets$HiddenShowDates\" type=\"hidden\" id=\"HiddenShowDates\" />\n\n                \n\n                <div id=\"FullWidth_SelectTickets_LoadingSpinner\" class=\"loading\" style=\"display: none;\">\n                    <img src=\"https://cdn.outsavvy.com/website/outsavvyloadingnew.gif\" style=\"margin: 0 auto; width: 85px; height: auto; padding: 20px;\" alt=\"Loading image\" />\n                </div>\n\n                <div id=\"FullWidth_SelectTickets_PlaceholderTickets\">\r\n\t\t\n\n                    <div id=\"FullWidth_SelectTickets_LoadingTicketBox\" class=\"ticket-box-loader\">\n\n                        \n\n                        \n\n                        \n\n                        \n\n                        \n\n                        \n\n                        <div class=\"ticket-box\">\n\n                            <div class=\"app-basket\" id=\"ticket_basket\">\n\n\n\n                                \n                                        <div class=\"line-red-holder\">\n                                            <h4 class=\"line-red\">Tickets\n                                    \n\n                                            </h4>\n                                        </div>\n                                        <div class=\"ticket-accordion\">\n                                    \n\n                                        \n\n                                        <div>\r\n\t\t\t\n                                            <div>\n                                                <div>\n                                                    <div>\n                                        \r\n\t\t</div>\n\n                                        \n                                            \n\n                                                <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"ctl00$FullWidth$SelectTickets$RepeaterTicketCategories$ctl01$RepeaterTicketTypes$ctl01$HiddenFieldDealId\" id=\"FullWidth_SelectTickets_RepeaterTicketCategories_RepeaterTicketTypes_0_HiddenFieldDealId_0\" value=\"177565\" />\n                                                <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"ctl00$FullWidth$SelectTickets$RepeaterTicketCategories$ctl01$RepeaterTicketTypes$ctl01$HiddenFieldDiscountId\" id=\"FullWidth_SelectTickets_RepeaterTicketCategories_RepeaterTicketTypes_0_HiddenFieldDiscountId_0\" />\n\n                                                \n\n                                                \n\n                                                \n\n                                                \n\n                                                    <div class=\"strikethrough bottomborder\">\n\n                                                        <div class=\"ticket-group\">\n\n                                                            \n\n                                                            <div class=\"ticket-detail ticket-detail-name\">\n\n                                                                \n\n                                                                <div class=\"ticket-name-holder\">\n\n                                                                    <span class=\"ticket-name crossout\">\n                                                                        Guaranteed seating for these tickets. Must be seated by 7:45pm to keep the seats\n                                                                            <span class=\"ticket-status\"> <span class='waiting-list'>Sold Out</span> </span>\n\n                                                                            \n\n                                                                    </span>\n\n                                                                    \n\n                                                                </div>\n\n                                                                <div class='ticket-time-holder crossout'><i class='sub-margin'><svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' width='23' height='23' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none'><circle cx='12' cy='12' r='9' stroke='#ff5a5f' stroke-width='3' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'></circle><path d='M12 6.5V12L16 14' stroke='#ff5a5f' stroke-width='2' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'></path></svg> 7:00 AM - 11:55 PM</i></div>\n                                                            </div>\n\n                                                            <div class=\"ticket-detail ticket-detail-price text-right crossout\">\n\n                                                                £16\n\n                                                                <div class=\"fees\">\n                                                                    Booking Fee\n                                                                    :&nbsp;£1.54\n                                                                </div>\n\n                                                                \n\n                                                            </div>\n\n                                                            \n\n                                                                <div class=\"ticket-detail ticket-detail-quantity\" id=\"ticket-detail-quantity\">\n\n                                                                    \n                                                                        <div class=\"ticket-dropdown-holder\">\n                                                                            <div class=\"ticket-dropdown-title-holder\">\n                                                                                <label for=\"ctl00_FullWidth_SelectTickets_RepeaterTicketCategories_ctl01_RepeaterTicketTypes_ctl01_DropDownList1\" class=\"ticket-dropdown-title\">Qty</label><select name=\"ctl00$FullWidth$SelectTickets$RepeaterTicketCategories$ctl01$RepeaterTicketTypes$ctl01$DropDownList1\" id=\"ctl00_FullWidth_SelectTickets_RepeaterTicketCategories_ctl01_RepeaterTicketTypes_ctl01_DropDownList1\" disabled=\"disabled\" class=\"aspNetDisabled droptickets\">\r\n\t\t\t<option selected=\"selected\" value=\"0\">0</option>\r\n\r\n\t\t</select>\n                                                                            </div>\n                                                                        </div>\n\n                                                                    \n\n                                                                </div>\n\n                                                            \n\n                                                        </div>\n\n                                                        \n\n                                                            <div class=\"ticket-group\">\n\n                                                                